4/S45-s35/Garden.jpg", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//2.bp.blogspot.com/_HcAqJyCOr4E/TOvWLPPYiCI/AAAAAAAAADg/8X3xTjYJFHM/S45-s35/P1000052.JPG", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//2.bp.blogspot.com/-79pjwLUvjGc/WcsoSP2YqrI/AAAAAAAAARQ/VsAAnjtA8k8gv1gVAjerXyHsueNvQio4gCK4BGAYYCw/s35/1a.jpg", "//4.bp.blogspot.com/-MryKp9ZuUHQ/VbyVf-w6mLI/AAAAAAAAAus/GfoxYfWbMk0/s35/*", "//1.bp.blogspot.com/_8QGH0pcD4JY/SebPfWRn9RI/AAAAAAAAAA0/6KTtJMptihA/S45-s35/Water%2Blilies.jpg", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png"]}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640922739", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=ayam&updated-max=2018-09-22T07:41:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=243&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2017/03/mini-chicken-pot-pie-yang-mudah-dan.html", "list_item_title": "Mini Chicken Pot Pie Yang Mudah Dan Sangat Sedap", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "3/14/2017", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n17\n                              Comments\n                           \n", "list_item_category": "\nDessert\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Dessert?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640922742", "page_title": "Mini Chicken Pot Pie Yang Mudah Dan Sangat Sedap", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "3/14/2017", "page_item_category": ["Dessert", "Kuih Muih", "Pie", "Western Food"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Dessert?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Kuih%20Muih?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Pie?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Western%20Food?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Terlebih dahulu saya ingin mengucapkan jutaan terima kasih atas sokongan padu pembaca semua pada blog Azie Kitchen. Alhamdulillah page view Azie Kitchen telah melebihi 102 juta. Terima kasih tidak terhingga. Ianya benar benar menyuntik semangat untuk saya terus menulis. Sebenarnya telah lama\u00a0saya tak menyediakan kuih muih apalagi kuih kuih ala ala western gini.\u00a0", "Resepi pun saya adaptasi dari Betty Crocker. Kadang kadang kita rasa malas untuk menyediakan pie kerana agak remeh untuk menyediakan pastri. Tapi dengan pot pie, sangat mudah dan yang penting sangat", "\u00a0sedap. Saya sangat seronok kerana", "\u00a0anak anak semua suka dan memberi komen yang ianya sangat sedap. Sekelip mata dah licin. Intinya bolehlah diubahsuai dengan memasukkan brokoli atau apa apa bahan lain seperti udang", "\u00a0bagi menggantikan ayam. Pendek kata bolehlah diubahsuai mengikut bahan yang ada di dapur kita.", "Tapi satu bahan yang wajib ada dalam menyediakan pot pie yang sedap adalah serbuk lada hitam berperisa Aji-Shio. Ianya memang secukup rasa kerana telah mengandungi bahan perasa serta lada hitam nya yang memberi rasa kepedasan yang sukar diungkap dengan kata kata. Tak perlu lagi memasukkan lain lain bahan perasa. Saya memang setia dengan jenama Aji-Shio untuk serbuk lada hitam atau serbuk lada putih.", "Saya membuat sendiri Bisquick kerana tak jumpa original Bisquick mix di Giant. Saya juga tidak menggunakan chicken broth, sebaliknya hanya menggunakan air sahaja yang bila direbus ayam akan menjadi sedap rasa air rebusan ayam", ".\u00a0", "Saya sangat sangat rekemen anda semua untuk mencuba resepi pot pie yang ringkas dan sedap ini. Rugi jika anda tidak mencubanya. Kalau beli di kedai, memang sangat mahal dan belum tentu rasanya sesedap yang disediakan sendiri di rumah. Jika anda ingin melihat dengan jelas cara penyediaannya, saya ada sediakan video. Boleh singgah\u00a0di Instagram Azie Kitchen @aziekitchen untuk melihat video, juga video yang lebih panjang di youtube Azie Kitchen Channel. Di bawah ini juga, saya sediakan gambar langkah demi langkah untuk rujukan anda semua.\u00a0", "\n", "Jom layan resepi yang sangat mudah dan yang penting sangat sedap. Boleh disediakan untuk hidangan petang. Selamat mencuba resepi ringkas untuk membuat pie versi pot pie.\u00a0Jom layaan...", "Oleh: ", "Bahan bahan:", "I sudu besar minyak sayuran", "2 keping dada ayam - potong kecil", "1 biji bawang besar - cincang jadi \u00bd cawan", "\u00bd cawan air rebusan ayam - guna air sahaja", "2\u00a0cawan sayuran campuran", "\u00bd sudu kecil garam halus", "\u00bc sudu kecil serbuk lada hitam berperisa AJI-SHIO\u00ae ", "\u00bc sudu kecil daun thyme", "1 cawan parutan cheese ", "Bahan pastri", "\u00bd cawan Original Bisquick\u2122 mix - lihat resepi di bawah", "\u00bd cawan susu segar", "2 biji telur", "Cara cara:", "Panaskan oven pada suhu 190C. Spray loyang muffin dengan cooking spray.\u00a0", "Panaskan minyak dalam kuali dan masakkan ayam dalam 5-7 minit sehingga ianya hampir masak. Masukkan bawang besar dan kacau seketika sebelum dituang sedikit air rebusan ayam. Masak hingga menggelegak. Saya hanya menggunakan air sahaja.", "Masukkan sayuran campuran, garam, serbuk lada hitam berperisa Aji-Shio\u00ae dan daun thyme. Masak sehingga sebati. Sesuaikan rasa.", "Tutup api dan biarkan dalam 5 minit sebelum dimasukkan parutan keju.", "Di dalam bekas lain, satukan bahan pastri menggunakan whisk.\u00a0", "Masukkan 1 sudu bahan pastri ke dalam bekas muffin. Masukkan \u00bc cawan bahan inti ayam. Dan akhir sekali tuang lagi 1 sudu besar bahan pastri di atasnya.", "Bakar selama 25 hingga 30 minit atau sehingga tidak melekat pada lidi. Sejukkan selama 5 minit. Dengan menggunakan pisau kecil, lalukan sekeliling pie dan keluarkan dari loyang. Sejukkan di atas rack selama 10 minit sebelum sedia untuk dinikmati.", "Bahan bahan:", "1 cawan all purpose flour", "1 1/2 sudu kecil baking powder", "1/4 sudu kecil garam\u00a0", "1 sudu besar mentega\u00a0", "Cara cara:", "Ayak gandum bersama baking powder dsn garam sehingga sebati. Masukkan butter ke dalam bahan tepung dan gaul sebati.\u00a0", "Nota:", "Boleh juga guna shortening atau minyak sebagai ganti mentega. Jika menggunakan mentega cair, pastikan ianya bergaul rata.\u00a0"], "page_description_image_url": ["https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-iUSRLkmovNo/WI_ZxA6vJPI/AAAAAAAAqvI/O63jjZ43MfsghdcE8p1hpyXCQtS1mXfjQCLcB/s640/IMG_3027.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-mMK-RTZt5OY/WI_ZzLvDtwI/AAAAAAAAqvM/qOVL3Q60jhw675X3i5pS6XJyXReIPJXTgCLcB/s640/IMG_3049.jpg", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-iUSRLkmovNo/WI_ZxA6vJPI/AAAAAAAAqvI/O63jjZ43MfsghdcE8p1hpyXCQtS1mXfjQCLcB/s640/IMG_3027.jpg", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-ctf9D5QJyUM/WI4S1oWSr1I/AAAAAAAAqtI/z1AMgglSXrcT7LHwOLWGs4lk8mqesX0wwCLcB/s640/IMG_3047.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-NhfRJKG9NQU/WI4SyVM3SpI/AAAAAAAAqs0/aKiUpzy1Ha8ooXegHTyd15R3ZEKyENqOACLcB/s640/IMG_2940.jpg", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-kFWG0yyUypE/WI4VJquPHhI/AAAAAAAAqt4/cWqATFTbgwY5oxVK5gAzFdxvn-Ofcc86wCLcB/s640/IMG_2941.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-l1yXWYNdD0g/WI4Sy3_X7GI/AAAAAAAAqs8/HGrsaAnaDf89hmRQ0syLLFIUvA8U9mMPACLcB/s640/IMG_2957.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-OtlIoEJS2uQ/WI4Sy76_sRI/AAAAAAAAqs4/B5o9gxYanqIAbyVqeyx6qCfjeRjZhtn0ACLcB/s640/IMG_2961.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-GnGQcMJ09OI/WI4S0wY_aqI/AAAAAAAAqtA/DQ4pliCibvcL0FTrupx-dl3AN7zCP1uZwCLcB/s640/IMG_2963.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-gL4kg_lfYSA/WI4S1j1GmII/AAAAAAAAqtE/qGnVlkxhHYImBmxbobxnCunG0sEcd-8XACLcB/s640/IMG_2975.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-ljhREqofuv8/WI4S1xO4QBI/AAAAAAAAqtM/sypT-VFPznkdEJaQWGpVtSmUUdjdL99-QCLcB/s640/IMG_3052.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-imXMn2aSv3A/WI4SvshpF1I/AAAAAAAAqsw/cKz7ZizQwBUCE-uXV10HcW3sSo0gq9ESgCLcB/s640/IMG_2926.jpg"], "page_ulasan_count": "17 ulasan", "page_comment": ["Kak Azie, your mini chicken pot pies are so cute and adorable! ", "Dear, must try this. ", "salam kak azie, resipi ni utk berapa ye kuantiti pies?", "Wslm. Dapat 12 biji pie yg saiz agak besar", "haah sennag sgt resepinya. ok nnt nak buat la ;)", "yummy....nampak sangat sedap...boleh la dicuba weekend nnti...", "Bahan pastri itu bila di masak adakah ia lembut dan lembab atau macam  texture pastri biasa ia itu sedikit crunchy.", "Terima kasih.", "isi nampak padat", "Kak zie klu nk wat bisness brp sbj", "Dear, cuba buat dulu. Kira berapa kos bahan. Tambah kos upah dan kos air elektrik. Dari situ, bolehlah mark up brp untung yang diperlukan. ", "Hi Kak Azie,", "I've always looked to your recipes to get inspiration of what yummy homemade food to make. I've been in the UK for 19 years now and your recipes certainly brings back good memories.", "I'm in the middle of making this but just realised that your version bisquick mix says 1 cup flour to make this but your recipe says use 1/2 cup pre-made bisquick mix. Help!! ", "Anyways I shall agak2 and do it. ", "Thanks for sharing your recipes.", "Liza", "X", "Hi Liza, ", "Yes, use only 1/2 cup. Balance can store it in an airtight container or plastic bag in a cool, dry place, like on your pantry shelf. For long-term storage, keep it in the refrigerator or freezer.", "salam kak.. nak tanya keju tu nak guna yang jenis apa..", "salam kak Azie,", "your chicken pot pie looks yummy! i want to try to make it but i was a bit confused with the bisquick mix recipe that you noted down was a bit different with the picture ingredient for bisquick that you attached. may i know what's for milk, cheese and egg in the picture attached? is it the mixture with bisquick ingredient?", "thank you for your reply.", "Anna", "Wslm Anna, ", "Follow the recipe. Photo is not intended to show the ingredienrs for bisquickmix. ", "nampak sedap kak Azie...terima kasih ...suka dgn kak azie tau..", "hi kak,", "1) boleh ke tukar minyak sayur kepada olive oil/coconut oil?", "2) boleh ke tukar parsley instead of thyme?", "3) crispy x pie ni?"], "page_comment_time": ["14 Mac, 2017 19:29", "14 Mac, 2017 19:36", "15 Mac, 2017 12:41", "15 Mac, 2017 13:21", "15 Mac, 2017 13:32", "15 Mac, 2017 13:54", "15 Mac, 2017 15:02", "16 Mac, 2017 13:37", "18 Mac, 2017 11:34", "18 Mac, 2017 18:56", "18 Mac, 2017 21:00", "18 Mac, 2017 22:14", "20 Mac, 2017 18:38", "31 Mei, 2017 15:21", "31 Mei, 2017 15:58", "17 November, 2017 10:33", "15 Ogos, 2018 03:29"], "page_comment_user": ["PH", "Azie", "Unknown", "Azie", "Myalycia", "HeNRieTTa JoSe", "hmg", "Mar Mansor", "Unknown", "Azie", "Liza H", "Azie", "JoyZaha", "Unknown", "Azie", "RahmatangMarsuki", "Mak"], "page_comment_user_url": ["https://www.blogger.com/profile/11010771600736676432", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/12196479264332805280", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/00480017272102198119", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/04613180564675857370", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02370380135120894975", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/17348213355495658834", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/15759373069601504597", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/05338516638534703448", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/06621121205356086503", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/18056369183410109065", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/05966486646428651591", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02502545725705062466"], "page_comment_user_image_url": ["//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//4.bp.blogspot.com/-wGzYxEoB1xA/WNMYI9BHdcI/AAAAAAAAGaI/7m89VWBJeb88aYHH3k3nUeOTOWB1ZuWiACK4B/s35/HS3.jpg", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//4.bp.blogspot.com/-jIEGxXvkVK0/YHlCrx3hrrI/AAAAAAAAPVc/NyAWA0Qj8LsGkKNnTNs_lzVYJqm0V_nQACK4BGAYYCw/s35/20210416_155119.jpg", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png"]}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640922739", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=ayam&updated-max=2018-09-22T07:41:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=243&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2014/03/gulai-ayam-daun-limau-purut.html", "list_item_title": "Gulai Ayam Daun Limau Purut", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "3/24/2014", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n2\n                              Comments\n                           \n", "list_item_category": "\nAyam\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Ayam?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640922742", "page_title": "Gulai Ayam Daun Limau Purut", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "3/24/2014", "page_item_category": ["Ayam", "Lauk Pauk"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Ayam?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Lauk%20Pauk?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Ini adalah entri tertunda di mana hari itu\u00a0saya memang buntu, tak tahu apa yang hendak dimasak untuk hidangan tengahari. Saya pun mula menanya Pak Cik Google apa menu yang\u00a0boleh diguna. Dalam tercari cari, saya terpandang satu gambar yang membuatkan saya terus menelan air liur, aduhaaai sedaaap nyeer. Cepat cepat menghantar whatsApp kat hubby di pejabat meminta dibelikan bahan bahan yang diperlukan. Saya memasak sambil mendengar sidang media khas Mencari MH370 yang dibuat oleh Perdana Menteri. Sedih bila mendengar hasil siasatan awal yang menunjukkan kapalterbang telah membuat air turn back dan transponder telah dimatikan apabila menghampiri sempadan Vietnam. Komunikasi terakhir antara satelit ialah pada 8.11 pagi pada 8 Mac 2014. Deliberate action by someone on the plane, itulah kesimpulan awal sehingga setakat ini. Sedih sungguh sedih sekiranya ianya adalah perbuatan yang melibatkan konspirasi kerana ia melibatkan penganiayaan pada ramai penumpang dan keluarga.", "Saya memang suka gulai yang dimasak dengan daun limau purut. Memang sangat sedap kerana saya memang menyukai apa apa masakan yang menggunakan daun limau purut seperti Mee Hoon Goreng Limau Purut, yang sangat saya sukai.", "Jom kita tengok resepi yang saya gunakan hari ini...", "Oleh: ", "Bahan bahan:", "1 ekor ayam - potong 8", "10 biji cili kering\u00a0", "1 biji bawang besar", "3 ulas bawang merah", "3 ulas bawang putih", "2 batang serai", "1 inci kunyit", "1 inci halia", "1 inci lengkuas", "2 keping asam keping", "2 cawan santan -1 santan kotak", "1 sudu besar biji ketumbar", "1 sudu makan campuran jintan putih dan manis", "Garam", "Gula\u00a0", "Cara cara:", "Kisar cili kering, bawang, bawang putih, halia, lengkuas, serai, kunyit, ketumbar dan jintan dengan sedikit air.", "Satukan rempah yang di kisar dengan ayam dalam satu periuk. Reneh ayam hingga ayam kecut.", "Masukkan santan dan asam keping. Boleh masukkan sedikit air lagi jika ingin kuah lebih. Masak hingga agak pekat sedikit. Sesuai rasa garam dan gulanya.", "Masukkan daun limau purut. Kacau seketika dan angkat."], "page_description_image_url": ["https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Sgc3smzOx0I/UyQMecXz8QI/AAAAAAAAdrg/zHQv-QeTMyI/s640/IMG_3144.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-cv41UZgKHHs/UyQMege0ugI/AAAAAAAAdrk/EayS6E5SudI/s1600/IMG_3145.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-DR6CFk5q9Fg/UyQMd_gUPNI/AAAAAAAAdrU/-S4tyYIRLCU/s1600/IMG_3041.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-RIVD0OQKh4M/UyQMd2s6MzI/AAAAAAAAdrY/N4xJp7JpClA/s1600/IMG_3071.jpg"], "page_ulasan_count": "2 ulasan", "page_comment": ["Hi Azie! I have got to try this chicken curry. I love any curry that has daun limau purut in it. So fragrant! It is quite frustrating due to the water rationing and I can't cook when there is no water during the weekends. Let's hope it rains soon for this to be over.", "It is really sad that MH 370 has been confirmed lost with no survivors. May those that perish rest in peace and that their families and loved ones find strength to cope with this very painful and difficult time.", "True dear. This is a very sad tragedy. Hope the families of the crews and passengers will be strong to face this sad episode."], "page_comment_time": ["25 Mac, 2014 11:27", "25 Mac, 2014 21:34"], "page_comment_user": ["PH", "Azie"], "page_comment_user_url": ["https://www.blogger.com/profile/11010771600736676432", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318"], "page_comment_user_image_url": ["//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*"]}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640922739", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=ayam&updated-max=2018-09-22T07:41:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=243&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2012/03/chicken-mandy-rice.html", "list_item_title": "Chicken Mandy Rice", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "3/28/2012", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n34\n                              Comments\n                           \n", "list_item_category": "\nNasi\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Nasi?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640922744", "page_title": "Chicken Mandy Rice", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "3/28/2012", "page_item_category": ["Nasi", "Nasi Arab"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Nasi?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Nasi%20Arab?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Hubby menghantar bbm meminta agar saya memasak malam ni samada nasi arab atau beriani kerana beliau akan kembali ke pejabat untuk mesyuarat.\u00a0", "Saya teringatkan resepi nasi Mandy yang dibuat oleh Rozilah yang hanya perlu merebus ayamnya, tanpa perlu dibakar. Saya fikir elok juga jika saya cuba resepi ini untuk tujuan kelainan. Resepi nasi Mandy yang saya buat dulu, saya membakar ayamnya di dalam oven. Klik di\u00a0", "\u00a0untuk melihat resepi nasi Mandy saya sebelum ini.", "Balik dari pejabat terus singgah di kedai runcit untuk membeli ayam dan timun. Bahan lain semuanya sudah ada dalam peti ais. Sampai jer di rumah, saya terus memasak. Sangat cepat memasaknya. Dapur saya harum semerbak dengan bau nasi Mandy. Hmmm best nyeerrr...", "Chicken Mandy Rice", "Oleh: ", "Bahan A", "4 cawan beras basmathi\u00a0", "\u00bd", "\u00a0cawan minyak zaitun\u00a0\u00a0", "2 biji bawang besar - potong dadu\u00a0", "5 ulas bawang putih - mayang\u00a0", "\u00bd", "\u00a0cm kulit kayu manis\u00a0", "1 kuntum bunga lawang\u00a0", "2 biji buah pelaga\u00a0", "5 tangkai bunga cengkih\u00a0", "1 helai daun bay ", "3 helai daun pandan - tak letak ", "1 ketul arang - dibakar hingga jadi bara\u00a0", "Bahan B\u00a0", "1 ekor ayam di potong 8", "\u00bd", "\u00a0cm halia\u00a0", "1 sudu kecil serbuk ketumbar\u00a0", "1 sudu kecil serbuk jintan manis\u00a0", "1 sudu kecil serbuk jintan putih\u00a0", "1 sudu kecil serbuk kunyit\u00a0", "1 sudu kecil serbuk lada hitam\u00a0", "1 helai daun salam\u00a0 ", "1 sudu makan minyak masak\u00a0", "1 liter air (agak2 ayam tenggelam)\u00a0", "Garam dan gula secukup rasa\u00a0", "Cara cara:", "Kesemua bahan bahan B dididihkan di dalam periuk sehingga ayam masak. Angkat ayam dan toskan. Lumurkan ayam ini dengan minyak. Manakala air rebusannya disimpan utk memasak nasi. Ketepikan.\u00a0", "Panaskan minyak zaitun dan tumiskan semua bahan bahan tumisan bersama 3 helai daun pandan sehingga naik bau.\u00a0", "Masukkan beras dan goreng seketika. Curahkan 5 cawan air rebusan ayam tadi. Pindahkan ke dalam rice cooker.", "Masak nasi sehingga kering. Kemudian susunkan ayam di atas nasi dan buatkan lubang ditengah2 nasi. Letakkan aluminium foil di tengah tengah nasi.\u00a0", "Masukkan\u00a0 minyak dan arang yg telah menjadi bara ke dalam aluminium tersebut.\u00a0", "Tutup periuk nasi dengan kertas aluminium dan kemudiannya tutup dengan periuk nasi supaya aroma asap terperangkap di dalam periuk.\u00a0", "Masak lagi nasi itu sehingga 5-10 minit atau sehingga nasi masak. Setelah itu angkat dan hidangkan bersama salsa.", "Bahan bahan:\u00a0", "4 biji buah tomato - potong dadu\u00a0", "1 batang timun dibuang biji - potong dadu\u00a0", "1 labu bawang besar - potong dadu\u00a0", "2 tangkai cili merah - dimayang halus\u00a0", "2 tangkai cili hijau - dimayang halus", "5 tangkai cili padi - dimayang halus\u00a0", "1 biji lemon diperah ambil jusnya\u00a0", "1 sudu makan minyak zaitun\u00a0", "Garam\u00a0\u00a0", "Gula\u00a0", "Cara cara:\u00a0", "Campurkan kesemua bahan2 di atas. Gaul mesra di salam satu mangkuk. Perasakan sehingga cukup rasa dan sedia utk dihidangkan bersama Nasi Mandy."], "page_description_image_url": ["https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-jFnXydknZFY/T3MFAUgiFKI/AAAAAAAAI8M/SnoR1uCdnyo/s640/IMG_9223.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-NX7Xji-N9Ps/T3ME43kM8PI/AAAAAAAAI7k/twb0zonatEc/s640/IMG_9212.jpg", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-jFnXydknZFY/T3MFAUgiFKI/AAAAAAAAI8M/SnoR1uCdnyo/s640/IMG_9223.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-F0R9GkQ4cnc/T3L5sQ4RuVI/AAAAAAAAI6E/8idazMvA7U0/s640/IMG_9168.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-TLLWo1AfBso/T3L5yHglKhI/AAAAAAAAI6k/EUB8Z8cKDdc/s640/IMG_9193.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-7tk4W5miRAg/T3L5p0OuVnI/AAAAAAAAI50/UxkqKKVtnLQ/s640/IMG_9163.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-kPCi09W0KMU/T3L5rLhRBXI/AAAAAAAAI58/aW1wbK8Hho4/s640/IMG_9165.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-tP9_whGSx4M/T3L5vZEWi3I/AAAAAAAAI6U/cCcXWgINEjs/s640/IMG_9181.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-UDYr9mETxsI/T3L5w-Hl2AI/AAAAAAAAI6c/xSGDa_15e7E/s640/IMG_9187.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-Dv0y6OmZO-0/T3L52vEW-oI/AAAAAAAAI68/q6kP2GjAV_8/s640/IMG_9206.jpg", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-yDCaIS6Tih0/T3L53xNw1xI/AAAAAAAAI7E/8rZVhvsgFgI/s640/IMG_9207.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-WwwRhEJPVPs/T3MFDEhlf_I/AAAAAAAAI8c/-eemm57DV4o/s640/IMG_9227.jpg", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-er3_xUJwRQk/T3ME9iEas3I/AAAAAAAAI78/vz_wNs3u2gU/s640/IMG_9219.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-cDvOhemeYS8/T3L5zgYvFkI/AAAAAAAAI6s/XylFMmZqlWE/s640/IMG_9203.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-_47OTLPgkTw/T3ME-zXOevI/AAAAAAAAI8E/LovVRVCtLe4/s640/IMG_9222.jpg"], "page_ulasan_count": "34 ulasan", "page_comment": ["Kak Azie, I have tried your Chicken Mandy Rice..thumbs up mmg sedap la...dah lama cr resepi yg simple & senang.. Ari2 pun blh masak..thanks for the recipe.", "Terima kasih atas feedback yang diberi. Semoga boleh dijadikan rujukan pembaca yang lain pula", "Saya terlupa letak garam masa masak Ayam tu... Spoil my fist attempt heee", "mohon copy", "kak...bara arang tu utk ape?mmg sedap nampaknye...", "Nasi mandy dibakar dengan api di dalam tanah. Tujuan diletak arang supaya asapnya dpt mewangikan nasi seolah ianya dimasak di atas dapur arang. Memang semerbak baunya. Asap itu akan terperangkap dalam periuk yg ditutup. ", "Kak tq share this resepi. Saya sudah 2 kali masak dlm seminggu ni. Today lunch pun baru masak, family semua suka. Thanx a lot kak. Cuma mcmn klu x nak bg beras patah yer, sy msk pakai beras extra long tp patah juga lah kak.", "Tahniah kr berjaya memasaknutk keluarga. Apa yg saya tahu, kurangkan mengacau beras supaya tidak patah", "Salam..", "Sy xphm bhgn arang tu..letak minyak dlm foil then letak arang?xpdm ke arang tu nnti..then kene bungkus ke arang tu?", "Betul tu. arang yg membara bila kena minyak akan mengeluarkan asap. Kita nak perangkap asap supaya nasi berbau seolah dibakar dengan arang.", "Assalamualaikum", "In shaa Allah memang kena cuba resipi ni.....", "Terbaik", "Assalamualaikum, wah nampak simple.boleh ke nak cuba 1st time ni.takut je tak jadi..:) hehe", "Ahad ni  nk try la", "Akak masak lagi 5-10 min maksud dia masak ats api or masak pakai rice cooker dgn arang2 tu sekali?", "Lepas masuk arang, ia akan berasap. Tutup periuk dan biarkan lagi 5-10 minit baru asap tu menyerap ke dalam nasi. ", "akak ni utk brapa org makan?", "Tak pasti pulak sb saya hanya memasak untuk keluarga sendiri. Mereka makan berulang ulang. Mungkin utk 10 orang kot", "salam kak alhamdulilah jadi lepas godek resepi akak ,+ mamasya +arab food betul betul best dan sama .suruh mak rasa dia kata dkt dah rasa dia dgn nasi taza kat mekah .terima kasih sangat sangat kak .nak try nasi kabsah pulak ,sebelum ni nasi mandhi nanti sy htr gambar .", "Akak tq atas resepi :) sedap...", "Arang tu nk prepare mcm utk bbq tu ke? Or bole bakar kt dapur gas je :)", "Cuma seketul kecil. Bakar atas dapur gas jer", "salam Pn Azie... semalam baru buat ikut sebijik resepi Pn cuma tak letak daun salam sbb tak jumpa kat kedai....,, mmg sedap dan senang sangat nak buatnya... saya recomend blog Pn kat adik beradik saya,.. nak resepi tgk sendir kat blog ,, many thanks Pn..", "salam ... ", "kt salsa tuh tabur  daun ape ye ?", "Nak cuba buat lah Azie menarik tgk. Thanks", "Nasi basmathi tu kena rendam dulu tak.. kalau di rendam berapa lama", "Assalam.. kalau pakai beras basmathi kena rendam dulu tak sebelum masak.. berapa lama nak rendam? ", "tq kak azie.tadi berbuka buat nasi mandy ni...algamdullilah menjadi.sedap.sy memang xpenah buat nasi2 camni...tp mengidam nak mkn..buat...sy buat utk 2 org je..tq kak azie.semoga d beri kesihatan yg baik utk trus share resepi utk kami ni...", "kak azie mohon share resepi", "Alhamdulillah..resepi yg simple tp sedap..da mencubanya, keluarga pun suka..t.ksh Azie.. :)", "Salam kak azie. Trima kasih utk resepi. Nak tanya, salsa tu klau tak letak minyak zaitun mcm mana ye?", "Saya pernah cuba resepi yg ni. Menjadi dan sedap sangat. Masak masa open house raya aritu. Family belah suami pon kata sedap. Terima kasih kak azie berkongsi resepi. ", "Assalamualaikum Azie. Saya selalu mencuba resepi blog ini. Tkasih berkongsi resepi. Semoga Allah merahmati Azie n family, in shaa Allah..aamiin ", "Sy dh 2 kali buat resepi azie ni. Mmg sedap. Recomended pd sape2 yg 1st time nk cuba. Suami dan ank2 mkn puas hati.Tq azie atas perkongsian resepi ni."], "page_comment_time": ["17 Jun, 2012 03:54", "17 Jun, 2012 22:37", "01 Ogos, 2016 20:13", "13 April, 2017 16:45", "16 Februari, 2013 19:15", "16 Februari, 2013 19:27", "12 Mei, 2013 15:27", "12 Mei, 2013 15:55", "14 Mei, 2013 16:58", "14 Mei, 2013 17:03", "31 Mei, 2013 19:40", "15 Jun, 2013 20:40", "22 Ogos, 2013 03:38", "22 Ogos, 2013 18:56", "25 Ogos, 2013 13:09", "25 Ogos, 2013 13:12", "27 Ogos, 2013 20:18", "27 Ogos, 2013 20:23", "17 September, 2013 15:02", "17 Oktober, 2013 12:07", "19 Oktober, 2013 16:11", "19 Oktober, 2013 16:46", "02 Januari, 2014 08:15", "06 Julai, 2014 18:59", "08 Julai, 2014 18:04", "12 Mac, 2015 16:34", "12 Mac, 2015 16:36", "22 Jun, 2015 20:36", "23 Jun, 2015 12:13", "02 September, 2015 14:14", "18 Disember, 2016 23:12", "19 Disember, 2016 00:18", "05 Julai, 2017 00:15", "01 Ogos, 2017 09:16"], "page_comment_user": ["Haniza", "Azie", "Unknown", "zairul", "Azie", "aliz", "Azie", "Azie", "suhaizan", "Unknown", "mychickenfloss", "Unknown", "Azie", "kitatauke", "Azie", "Unknown", "Unknown", "Unknown", "Azie", "Rdimple", "rass`iema", "Unknown", "Unknown", "Unknown", "Mama comel", "Mama comel", "Unknown", "Noor Amanie", "Noor Amanie", "Sid", "TupperwareJaja"], "page_comment_user_url": ["https://www.blogger.com/profile/08242599582642718762", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/01478483275639401233", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/06964177442544358747", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/09929694307562152338", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "http://itisafate.blogspot.com", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/11933852874272195125", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/08253968135710003490", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/12393421967738943801", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/09015891157348632346", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/11990096334816095267", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/00973276159718668771", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/12070898935390447352", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/01750963073514404414", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/14572415056904472044", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/07324022857278715895", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/10924467539909164201", "https://www.b