{"list_scraping_time": "1640922965", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=ayam&updated-max=2012-05-22T23:12:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=445&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2012/04/nasi-tomato-kukus-sajian-hari-minggu.html", "list_item_title": "Nasi Tomato Kukus, Sajian Hari Minggu", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "4/08/2012", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n12\n                              Comments\n                           \n", "list_item_category": "\nAyam\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Ayam?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640922970", "page_title": "Nasi Tomato Kukus, Sajian Hari Minggu", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "4/08/2012", "page_item_category": ["Ayam", "Daging", "Lauk Pauk", "Masakan Tradisional", "Nasi"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Ayam?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Daging?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Lauk%20Pauk?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Masakan%20Tradisional?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Nasi?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Sebenarnya dah lama saya ingin memasak Nasi Tomato sendiri. Biasanya Nana yang menyediakan Nasi Tomato dan saya pula menyediakan lauk pauk. Oleh kerana petang nanti saya akan berkumpul dan bersantai dengan kawan kawan Kolej Ketiga di rumah Dato' Salehuddin, jadi saya perlu menyediakan hidangan untuk anak anak di rumah.\u00a0", "Maklum mereka sekarang bukan mahu mengikut kita ke mana mana, apalagi ke rumah kawan kawan. Kalau ke shopping mall, mahulah mereka mengikut. Perjumpaan sepatutnya semalam tapi terpaksa ditunda atas sebab sebab teknikal, kata my hubby.\u00a0", "Sedang saya memasak, hubby menjenguk ke dapur dan memberitahu ingin menjemput Encik Fuzi dan Peggy, kawan sepejabat untuk datang makan tengahari bersama. Hmm nasib baik masa tu saya belum lagi menjerang nasi, sempat lah lagi menambah. Tapi seperti biasalah, periuk nasi kami ni kecil.\u00a0", "Jadi bila memasak dalam kuantiti yang banyak, air macam tak rata dan nasi tak masak sempurna. Panik juga sekejap. Nasib baik teringatkan periuk pengukus yang dibeli baru baru ini. Apa lagi, terus memindahkan nasi dari rice cooker ke dalam pengukus. Jadinya Nasi Tomato Kukus pulak, boleh tak gitu? Apa apa jer lah, yang penting nasi masak.\u00a0\u00a0", "Untuk Nasi Tomato hari ini, saya gandingkan dengan\u00a0", ",\u00a0", "\u00a0dan Acar Timun. Klik di link untuk melihat resepinya. Tak perlu nak search, lain kali senang nak buat rujukan. Nak citer sat, hari ini saya termalu sebab sebagai tuan rumah, saya makan menambah nambah kerana sedap nyer nasi tomato dengan lauk pauk yang disediakan. Hahaha\u00a0 masuk bakul angkat sendiri jap...", "Jom layan resepi dulu....", "NASI TOMATO KUKUS", "sumber: ", "\u00a0", "Oleh: ", "Bahan-Bahan:\u00a0", "5 cawan beras Basmathi - cuci dan toskan\u00a0", "1/2 cawan susu cair\u00a0", "4 biji tomato - cincang\u00a0", "1/2 cawan sos tomato\u00a0", "2 s/b majerin/minyak sapi\u00a0", "5 s/b minyak\u00a0", "Garam secukup rasa\u00a0", "Air (ikut sukatan beras dalam 5 cawan)\u00a0", "Daun pandan disimpul atau daun sup cincang\u00a0", "Bahan tumis\u00a0", "3 ulas bawang putih - hiris\u00a0", "5 ulas bawang merah - hiris\u00a0", "1 inci halia - hiris\u00a0", "3 biji Buah pelaga\u00a0", "3 biji Bunga cengkih\u00a0", "1 inci Kulit kayu manis\u00a0", "2 kuntum Bunga lawang\u00a0", "Cara cara:\u00a0", "Tumis bawang merah, putih, halia dan rempah dengan minyak dan minyak sapi hingga kuning dan naik bau.\u00a0", "Masukkan susu cair, tomato cincang, tomato sos, garam dan gaul rata. Tambah air, daun pandan dan\u00a0 masak sehingga air mendidih.\u00a0 ", "Masukkan beras. Alihkan ke dalam rice cooker dan masaklah seperti biasa.", "Apabila nasi telah kering, kacau rata perlahan lahan supaya nasi tidak patah dan hancur.\u00a0", "Boleh dihidangkan bersama lauk Beriani Kambing, Ayam Masak Merah dan Dalca atau Acar Timun..."], "page_description_image_url": ["https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-tS69SCvwanM/T4Iv_xyMWdI/AAAAAAAAJe4/80n5FDPt1T0/s640/IMG_0409.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-fk58CiY4Yb8/T4Iww1lKNLI/AAAAAAAAJfo/4O-ynIWq7FA/s640/IMG_0404.jpg", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-tS69SCvwanM/T4Iv_xyMWdI/AAAAAAAAJe4/80n5FDPt1T0/s640/IMG_0409.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-uk8L9urI9O8/T4IvstfyNTI/AAAAAAAAJeI/WH8hWWH0E4s/s640/IMG_0369.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-oUWwCrAz85k/T4IvvMT-MfI/AAAAAAAAJeQ/4lth6j6MkG4/s640/IMG_0371.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-VxZblC5uIIE/T4IvxwkMbqI/AAAAAAAAJeY/iaoW0UR2QNU/s640/IMG_0374.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-runkAUZ9s5g/T4IvzUbzFMI/AAAAAAAAJeg/B4MXlfOtClc/s640/IMG_0377.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-zrUPdVqTy4Y/T4Iv1gVMr3I/AAAAAAAAJeo/kWtX7aNTwxY/s640/IMG_0382.jpg", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-dWLXj-OqIUk/T4IxhtN6F0I/AAAAAAAAJfw/-aZMjIZuF08/s640/IMG_0418.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-OKhs9NpmkV4/T4IwFAKolcI/AAAAAAAAJfI/6Ic7FQinoCs/s640/IMG_0416.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-7dVyylPI7DY/T4Ki_ebwPZI/AAAAAAAAJf4/OHxRrBKrZhw/s640/IMG_0413.jpg"], "page_ulasan_count": "12 ulasan", "page_comment": ["Assalammualaikum kak azie... Nak Tanya.. hidangan nie untuk berapa orang makan ?", "As salam. Kalau di rumah kami 10 orang pun boleh. ", "Haaa.. ni lagi satu fav dish saya.. dh penah buat tp biasa pair up dengan ayam.masak merah biasa je.. nnti nak try masak beriani kambing tu.. ", "salam puan azie...kalau buah tomato tu ganti dgn tomato puree, blh x? nt nak guna brapa byk? tq pn.azie", "Salam puan azie klau nak masak 3cawan beras bhan2 yg lain semua sama sukatan ke?", "As salam, Puan Azie. Ada beberapa menu sudah saya cuba. Kebanyakkan client dtg dr semenanjung dan nampak kepuasan dr wajah mereka. Keep it up. Adalaka saya tambah sikit ramuan mengikut cara org kat Sarawak, namun kesedapan yg asli sememangnya dr Kak Azie sendiri. Wassalam.", "Assalamualaikum pn. azie.. saya dah mencuba resepi pn.. masyaAllah.. seronok tengok baik anak2 mahupun yg dewasa makan bertambah.. mohon halal yea ilmu masakan.. moga pn sentiasa dilimpahi rezki.. syukran!! \u2764\ufe0f", "Dah try. Memang sedapp. Tq puan azie \ud83d\ude18", "Guna beras biase boleh x kak", "Boleh", "Assalamualaikum kak Azie.saya mohon guna pakai resepi ya..\ud83d\ude0a", "Assalamualaikum puan. Guna rempah apa utk tumis?"], "page_comment_time": ["03 Jun, 2014 17:28", "03 Jun, 2014 17:45", "11 Julai, 2014 19:52", "26 Jun, 2015 13:17", "09 Disember, 2016 08:52", "06 Februari, 2017 17:51", "28 April, 2017 20:00", "02 Jun, 2017 13:26", "26 Jun, 2018 11:36", "26 Jun, 2018 13:19", "18 Julai, 2020 07:30", "20 Julai, 2021 08:14"], "page_comment_user": ["Unknown", "Azie", "Nida", "Ain Naim", "Unknown", "Unknown", "ctnurhusna", "iza shaklee", "Unknown", "Azie", "Unknown", "Arifah Azrie"], "page_comment_user_url": ["https://www.blogger.com/profile/07374589640428155063", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/00520116732922694940", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/10103885666849058965", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/12846518504686465762", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/15253050088394376600", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/07560899035084794257", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/13839255428563618263", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/10885935376179919062", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/00119325245731532820", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/08960672036669715885", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/15273514287679054647"], "page_comment_user_image_url": ["//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//2.bp.blogspot.com/-M97-LH3yaJc/XsHTN3yrgEI/AAAAAAAAWYQ/GFm0bnkOSH060JfcYejET8rdgtrS4rrHQCK4BGAYYCw/s35/photo_2020-05-16_10-27-06.jpg", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//2.bp.blogspot.com/-79pjwLUvjGc/WcsoSP2YqrI/AAAAAAAAARQ/VsAAnjtA8k8gv1gVAjerXyHsueNvQio4gCK4BGAYYCw/s35/1a.jpg", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png"]}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640922965", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=ayam&updated-max=2012-05-22T23:12:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=445&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2012/04/thank-you-laling.html", "list_item_title": "Thank You, Laling", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "4/20/2012", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n4\n                              Comments\n                           \n", "list_item_category": "\nUmum\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Umum?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640922971", "page_title": "Thank You, Laling", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "4/20/2012", "page_item_category": ["Umum"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Umum?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Sempena hari lahir saya pada 18 April, petang semalam hubby telah menghantar bbm untuk membawa saya dan anak anak makan malam di mana mana restoran pilihan saya. Oleh kerana saya baru sahaja memulakan program diet, jadi saya memilih\u00a0salmon sebagai menu untuk saya. Jadi hubby memutuskan untuk ke Tony Roma\u2019s kerana di sana citarasa semua dapat dipenuhi. Ada ikan, ada daging, ada nasi dan sebagainya. Maklumlah anak anak kami ada yang minat sirloin steak, ada yang suka lamb dan Boy pula suka ayam.", "Jom kita layan gambar gambar makanan yang kami nikmati semalam. Cuma makanan Boy jer tiada di dalam gambar.\u00a0Seperti biasa, Boy memilih ayam....", "Alhamdulillah atas rezeki yang diberi, sedap sekali makanan yang disediakan. Masya Allah. Kalau nak tahu, bolehlah pergi ke mana mana Tony Roma\u2019s yang berdekatan dengan tempat anda. Thank you so much, Laling for\u00a0lovely dinner celebration of my birthday. Of course, the real birthday present is the holiday to San Francisco and Las Vegas in 2 weeks time...."], "page_description_image_url": ["//3.bp.blogspot.com/-MsGBY-Xfwns/T5DxMFVuanI/AAAAAAAAKPg/oI0C8ZkEFiU/s400/IMG_1895.JPG", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-EsY7naKwbjU/T5DxbWjH9jI/AAAAAAAAKPo/Wtp0RVtQjZc/s400/IMG_1921.JPG", "//1.bp.blogspot.com/-vsZS8Fmg7VA/T5DxdBd8BZI/AAAAAAAAKPw/Jcirp8RKYCk/s400/IMG_1931.JPG", "//2.bp.blogspot.com/-tn3fz27zWGo/T5DxgEEr45I/AAAAAAAAKP4/Vrtd8nDXyVQ/s400/IMG_1935.JPG", "//4.bp.blogspot.com/-e5WMAS_LsH0/T5Dxh86A5BI/AAAAAAAAKQA/Qx9TD4o2g4g/s400/IMG_1939.JPG", "//4.bp.blogspot.com/-2maBWGuZHgw/T5EiPZRum6I/AAAAAAAAKQw/kevjL3vDUUo/s400/IMG_1941.JPG", "//2.bp.blogspot.com/-5RSYDk4A9vo/T5DxJEM2ovI/AAAAAAAAKPY/SWHxH_ADdbA/s400/IMG_1892.JPG"], "page_ulasan_count": "4 ulasan", "page_comment": ["amboi best nyeee Zie makan sedap nampak nya tu semoga happy dan bahagia selalu tentu tak sabar nak tunggu lagi 2 minggu kan mesti shopping sakan ni kan..", "Alhamdulillah dengan rezeki Nya, Kak Noor. I suka makan salmon. Sedap dan berkhasiat. Tengah excited, dok menghitung hari ni", "Salam k.Azie.hari istimewa diraikan bersama keluarga tersayang....makananpun sedap...moga sekeluarga sentiasa bahgia berpanjangan.k.Azie slmt bercuti ke US...", "Alhamdulillah Mamasya atas doa yg diberi. Semoga dipermudahkan segala urusan"], "page_comment_time": ["20 April, 2012 13:56", "20 April, 2012 14:03", "20 April, 2012 14:34", "20 April, 2012 14:37"], "page_comment_user": ["Unknown", "Azie", "Mamasya", "Azie"], "page_comment_user_url": ["https://www.blogger.com/profile/16832909324473758795", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/16844200994761824741", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318"], "page_comment_user_image_url": ["//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-gQDXZO1hkkw/UNKZMfT5S6I/AAAAAAAAQ0Q/McNJhfEGZMk/s35/DSC_6224.JPG", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*"]}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640922965", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=ayam&updated-max=2012-05-22T23:12:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=445&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2012/04/daging-masak-hitam.html", "list_item_title": "Daging Masak Hitam", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "4/01/2012", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n17\n                              Comments\n                           \n", "list_item_category": "\nDaging\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Daging?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640922974", "page_title": "Daging Masak Hitam", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "4/01/2012", "page_item_category": ["Daging", "Lauk Pauk"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Daging?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Lauk%20Pauk?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Hitam hitam si tampuk manggis, walaupun hitam ku pandang manis. Hitam hitam si daging hitam, namun hitamnya, sedap sekali. Hmm apa punya pantun ke apa ke ni. Bukan apa sebab warna daging ni, hitam betul. Hitam melegam gitu. Agaknya kicap pekat yang saya gunakan menjadikan warnanya yang sangat sesuai dengan nama resepi  ini.", "Selain lauk berkuah dan sayuran,saya juga menyediakan 2 jenis lauk kering iaitu sambal tumis telur rebus seperti yang saya sediakan semalam. Klik jer di ", " untuk melihat resepinya dan juga Daging Masak Hitam.\u00a0", "Kami memang jarang membeli daging, tak tahu kenapa begitu.  Mungkin juga kerana anak anak lebih gemar makan ayam berbanding dengan ayam, sedang saya sendiri sukakan daging. Jadi bila sekali sekala memasak untuk tetamu, saya mengambil kesempatan untuk memasak sesuatu yang saya jarang memasaknya. Ini bagi memastikan lauk pauk tidak membazir jika anak anak tak mahu memakan daging.", "Tekaan saya silap kerana ternyata masakan ini sangat sedap sehingga anak anak saya makan berulang ulang dalam masa beberapa jam sahaja. Malahan Aween bertanya kenapa sedikit sangat daging yang dimasak dan minta supaya saya memasaknya lagi. Jom layan resepi dulu...", "sumber: Hanieliza's Cooking", " Oleh: ", "500 gm daging [dipotong nipis]", "1 sudu besar serbuk jintan manis ]", "1 sudu kecil serbuk jintan putih\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0] bancuh dgn air rebusan", "4 sudu besar minyak masak", "5 sudu besar kicap pekat", "\u00bd", "\u00a0cawan jus asam jawa", "Gula secukupnya", "15 biji bawang merah", "3 ulas bawang putih", "3 cm halia", "15 tangkai cili kering", "Panaskan minyak dan tumiskan bahan mesin dan jintan yg dibancuhkan hingga wangi.", "Masukkan daging dan sedikit air. Biarkan sehingga lembut. Bila sudah lembut, masukkan kicap pekat.", "Masakkan sehingga pekat dan naik minyak. Rasakan garamnya.", "Bila telah masak boleh hidangkan.\u00a0"], "page_description_image_url": ["https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-4sbB9DWjlTo/T3feZZzdc-I/AAAAAAAAJF8/XohUgM_D9X4/s640/IMG_9682.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-jCyMkdsNg28/T3feWEe-YwI/AAAAAAAAJFs/M4hB9je5pRQ/s640/IMG_9668.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-7ZelmNriMOo/T3feeFyQcdI/AAAAAAAAJGU/IvVJntAI_q8/s640/IMG_9705.jpg", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-JC6-Pg24D_E/T3feOqNVX7I/AAAAAAAAJFE/NxBzyHXJiCI/s640/IMG_9603.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-vhm3-uz_FrI/T3feP6m17fI/AAAAAAAAJFM/6zGkaONCoIA/s640/IMG_9606.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-UcfNh3sriCk/T3feS7mo3wI/AAAAAAAAJFc/j44fFVv00Lc/s640/IMG_9647.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-EbfucBkrt8I/T3feUkoxb1I/AAAAAAAAJFk/sjjE3S9z_3M/s640/IMG_9653.jpg", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-9J9nlWs15BU/T3fefVAuyAI/AAAAAAAAJGc/z36i85MX7wo/s1600/IMG_9710.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-fsKoNnVF9To/T3fejGnTMXI/AAAAAAAAJGs/rYhQ-8Lqr74/s640/IMG_9723.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-4sbB9DWjlTo/T3feZZzdc-I/AAAAAAAAJF8/XohUgM_D9X4/s640/IMG_9682.jpg"], "page_ulasan_count": "17 ulasan", "page_comment": ["Salam kenal k.Azie.kalau masakan daging ada kicap gini mmg kegemaran kami sekeluarga...wpun hitam tp sedap.tahniah muncul di majalah...", "Salam Mamasya. Terima kasih kerana follow my blog. Kalau tengokkan warnanya tu memang menggerunkan tapi bila makan, aduhai sedapnyer. Mamasya ada blog juga ke? bolehlah I visit", "Assalam Azie, terima kasih sudi masuk dapur akak yang dah suam2 kuku tu..hehe.. Re:  Acuan Puding Roti Karamel tuh adalah acuan silicon...akak beli di Pantry Magic, Bangsar, KL hari tu (boleh tengok entry akak masa jalan2 di Pantry Magic dulu)... Boleh la terjah ke sana pulak...mahal tp berbaloiii...bakar kek pun senang, xyah nak gris or alas dulu...jimat masa.. ^__^", "Terima kasih, Ummi kerana sudi melawat dapur saya, budak yang baru belajar ni. Saya selalu masuk dapur akak. Banyak resepi menarik yang boleh digunakan untuk hidangan keluarga saya. Pantry Magic di kawasan mana ya? Tak apa, lepas ni nak bertandang ke dapur akak.", "salam kenal dan ziarah disini kak azie.", "baru terjumpa blog nie..nice blog la..suka daging tue..ratah mcmtu pun dah sedap tau..:)", "Salam kenal untuk Zila juga. Gembira kerana Zila sudi meluangkan masa untuk memberikan komen. Sebagai orang baru dalam blogging, saya sangat menhargai kawan kawan yang sudi mengenali dan menziarahi dapur saya. Daging tu memang sedap diratah begitu sahaja. Saya pun mencuri curi juga meratahnya.", "Betoi sgt2 kwn2 ..daging ni klu kena cara memasknya mmg sedap sgt..bru ni ada sy beli dn kebetulan sedap, ada pula terjumpa bahan penumis 4 bradik..mmg sedap smpai boleh diratah begitu sj..myb apa yg buat ia sedap ialah serbuk jintan2 dan kicap yg sedap(ni pun kdg2 nasib juga bila membelinya)", "Setuju, daging yg lembut, memang sedap berbanding dg ayam. Tapi agak sukar utk mendapatkan daging lembut spt daging batang pinang", "Hai tq share resepi yang sedap ni.", "salam kenal kak azie...sy yatie terngin nk mencuba masak hitam nie.", "sy dh mencuba resepi mee kari akak alhmdulillh sdp rasanya", ".thanks  sbb kongsi resepinye", "Salam kenal. Cubalah. Saya suka masakan ini. ", "salam..kak nk tnye ckit..daging tu kne rebus dulu ke?", "Lebih baik rebus sb daging lambat empuk", "Assalam kak azie, saya dah 3x buat, memang sedap, tapi jadi xhitam pekat, macam coklat2 skit, akak pakai kicap apa ye", "salam kak.. memang terbaik lah resepi daging masak hitam aak nie.. bahan2 pun senang.. saya kalau nak masak, mesti ikut resepi akak.. mudah dan cepat.. bahan2 pun memang yg simple2 je..", "Assalamualaikum. Saya nak cuba resepi ni. Boleh ke gantikan cili kering dengan cili giling? ", "salam kenal .saya yatee dari penang selalu jugak saya ikut resipi dari blog puan azie.terima kasih sebab semua resipi yg dikongsi selalu menjadi."], "page_comment_time": ["01 April, 2012 21:55", "01 April, 2012 22:05", "02 April, 2012 11:49", "02 April, 2012 21:18", "02 April, 2012 16:12", "02 April, 2012 21:20", "14 November, 2012 23:15", "14 November, 2012 23:55", "02 Jun, 2013 01:59", "14 November, 2013 21:49", "14 November, 2013 22:23", "17 Januari, 2014 19:50", "18 Januari, 2014 11:04", "25 Jun, 2015 16:32", "07 Julai, 2015 22:34", "21 Julai, 2015 15:46", "19 April, 2021 20:56"], "page_comment_user": ["Mamasya", "Azie", "Ummi", "Azie", "zila norazila", "Azie", "Unknown", "Azie", "iris bibi henna", "Unknown", "Azie", "Unknown", "Azie", "t a n g l o n g", "Unknown", "Myzonedr", "Unknown"], "page_comment_user_url": ["https://www.blogger.com/profile/16844200994761824741", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/05959086982995480870", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/06979736951824338575", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02251386079138732725", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/10726078103417357258", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/01492668608315603848", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/14781173279911891574", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/12395937807693154614", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/06939724377144154475", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/17956541738620346512", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/18013821601349564647"], "page_comment_user_image_url": ["//3.bp.blogspot.com/-gQDXZO1hkkw/UNKZMfT5S6I/AAAAAAAAQ0Q/McNJhfEGZMk/s35/DSC_6224.JPG", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//2.bp.blogspot.com/-NaDWyllaWGE/UVBSDcTu2zI/AAAAAAAAPpM/JCSqn1yWaaQ/s35/pic%25252Bblog%25252Bcropped.jpg", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//4.bp.blogspot.com/-8aKZv7guk3E/YGuZesN0kOI/AAAAAAAAsnw/tjisi9EyGpMRXUWokuIJEiT-bjqNydQKwCK4BGAYYCw/s35/IMG_20210125_162128_233.jpg", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//1.bp.blogspot.com/-Rr02FwFdNdg/TyDEJbKVJtI/AAAAAAAAAbg/8O6eCYfE0uw/s35/blog1.jpg", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//1.bp.blogspot.com/_uqx6PrK3No4/S0Um2YekwtI/AAAAAAAAABw/7aXza0XFeJM/S45-s35/DSC_0034.jpg", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png"]}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640922972", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=ayam&updated-max=2012-04-01T12:54:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=450&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2012/03/aduhai-nasi-lemak-nur-qaseh.html", "list_item_title": "Aduhai Nasi Lemak Nur Qaseh", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "3/29/2012", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n5\n                              Comments\n                           \n", "list_item_category": "\nNasi\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Nasi?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640922975", "page_title": "Aduhai Nasi Lemak Nur Qaseh", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "3/29/2012", "page_item_category": ["Nasi", "Nasi Lemak"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Nasi?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Nasi%20Lemak?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Huhuhu dah tahu malam hari tak boleh makan heavy, masak juga nasi lemak, apa citer? Apa nak buat, saya bekerja dan hanya boleh memasak waktu malam sahaja. Memang saya dah boleh nak mengawal selera terutama masakan saya sendiri yang sesuai dengan selera, lagi lah bertambah tambah.\u00a0", "Serius saya rasa sangat bersalah dengan diri sendiri. Nasi lemak ala ala Nasi Lemak Sahor malam ni sangat sangat sangat sedap. Siap minta hubby ke kedai runcit beli santan segar, tak mahu guna santan kotak bagi memastikan nasi lemak ini cukup lemak dan kaw. Apa sebabnya ya? Hanya saya saja yang tahu sebabnya, cuma saya belum bersedia untuk menulisnya di sini....\u00a0", "Berbalik pada nasi lemak malam ni, memang langsung tak plan untuk memasak pun tapi bila terpandang blog Kkida ada gambar sambal tumis telur rebus, terus jadi sangat terliur. Spontan jer masuk dapur terus rebus telur. Lepas tu, baru fikir untuk memasak nasi lemak kerana lebih simple dan tak perlu memasak banyak lauk pauk.\u00a0", "Hubby pulak menambah, kalau telur jer tak cukup, kena pulak keluarkan ayam untuk digoreng garam kunyit. Wangi jer bila menggunakan kunyit hidup. Itu sahaja lauk nasi lemak kami malam ni tapi memang sedap dan berselera sekali. Saya namakan nasi lemak ini sebagai Nasi Lemak Nur Qaseh lah...\u00a0", "Jom layan resepi dan gambar gambar....\u00a0", "\u00a0", "Oleh: ", "Bahan bahan:\u00a0", "3 biji bawang merah - hiris\u00a0", "1 inci halia - hiris\u00a0", "1 batang serai - ketuk\u00a0", "2 helai daun pandan - simpul\u00a0", "1 sudu besar mentega\u00a0", "Minyak masak\u00a0", "Santan\u00a0", "Garam\u00a0 ", "Serbuk kunyit\u00a0", "Cara cara\u00a0", "Panaskan minyak dan 1 sudu makan mentega. Tumis halia, bawang, serai dan daun pandan sehingga bawang layu dan wangi.\u00a0", "Masukkan beras yang telah dibasuh dan ditoskan. Goreng seketika sehingga rata.\u00a0", "Tuangkan santan dan air secukupnya. Masukkan garam dan sedikit serbuk kunyit bagi menaikkan warna. Pindahkan ke dalam rice cooker dan masak lah seperti biasa.\u00a0", "Hidangkan bersama Sambal Tumis Telur, Ayam Goreng garam kunyit dan hirisan timun.\u00a0", "\u00a0 ", "Aduhaaiii tak terkata dibuatnya...", "Enjoy ..."], "page_description_image_url": ["https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-2xGpXN1DC0Y/T3RtCVI2ybI/AAAAAAAAI-c/WWqnyeU0CX8/s640/IMG_9388.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-AjBrj8ub81I/T3RtA6YPAeI/AAAAAAAAI-U/jBqRqVzO9TQ/s640/IMG_9378.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-2xGpXN1DC0Y/T3RtCVI2ybI/AAAAAAAAI-c/WWqnyeU0CX8/s640/IMG_9388.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-BwBMAD_AfWc/T3Rs2_bFN5I/AAAAAAAAI9c/z0n0LnKpM94/s640/IMG_9248.jpg", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-rgjIGjZ5B4c/T3Rs4RqOPCI/AAAAAAAAI9k/dVrduvGEF7A/s640/IMG_9250.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Mo9OMFH-Xks/T3Rs5pTd7rI/AAAAAAAAI9s/zANBcVMVsGA/s640/IMG_9264.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-vJRMRt0_hbk/T3Rs8gKIwUI/AAAAAAAAI98/OEwmxduZjog/s640/IMG_9354.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-YQUc14fgOfc/T3Rs9-R1mEI/AAAAAAAAI-E/n2qg9Jx2k0M/s640/IMG_9369.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-AjBrj8ub81I/T3RtA6YPAeI/AAAAAAAAI-U/jBqRqVzO9TQ/s640/IMG_9378.jpg"], "page_ulasan_count": "5 ulasan", "page_comment": ["Kak, sy suka tgk resepi kat blog akk. Mostly semua resepi yg sy cuba jadi! Thanks kongsi ilmu msk2 :)", "Kak, boleh saya tau brapa byk air dan santan harus digunakan?", "Air bergantung kepada beras masing masing. Kalau memasak nasi menggunakan beras yg sama, berapa agak agak sukatan air yang digunakan. Santan pun setelah dicampurkan dg air, akan menjadi cairan yang bergantung kpd beras. Lagi banyak santan, lagi lemak dan sedap", "Kak nak tanye..akk gune beras jenama ape? Cantik Kejadian nasi nye \u263a", "-dayah-", "Terima kasih sb berkongsi resepi masakan.....mng berbaloi2...bahan pun sng d dpti dn mudah..."], "page_comment_time": ["20 Disember, 2015 23:00", "30 Januari, 2016 06:19", "30 Januari, 2016 19:22", "19 Julai, 2016 21:20", "09 Mei, 2017 11:48"], "page_comment_user": ["sHe", "Unknown", "Azie", "Unknown", "Unknown"], "page_comment_user_url": ["https://www.blogger.com/profile/08851367747020140347", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/05058689236672247505", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/14177452901327337650", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/10804840973683821122"], "page_comment_user_image_url": ["//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png"]}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640922972", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=ayam&updated-max=2012-04-01T12:54:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=450&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2012/02/nasi-goreng-kampung-yang-sangat-lah.html", "list_item_title": "Nasi Goreng Kampung Yang Sangat Lah Sedap Nyer", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "2/17/2012", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n15\n                              Comments\n                           \n", "list_item_category": "\nNasi\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Nasi?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640922975", "page_title": "Nasi Goreng Kampung Yang Sangat Lah Sedap Nyer", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "2/17/2012", "page_item_category": ["Nasi", "Nasi Goreng"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Nasi?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Nasi%20Goreng?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["\n", "Semasa seminar di Shah Alam Convention Centre tadi, saya makan nasi goreng yang fulamaakk sedap nyer walaupun saya masih kekenyangan dek breakfast dengan nasi dagang di Hartini Restaurant. Saya dan Sabariah kawan saya dari JB, cuba meneka bahan bahan yang digunakan.\u00a0", "Saya memang teruja sangat sangat untuk menyediakan nasi goreng yang sesedap ini. Jadi balik rumah, terus minta hubby ke kedai runcit untuk membeli udang dan cili merah untuk dimasak nasi goreng sebagai hidangan makan malam.", "\n", "Jom lah layan resepi yang saya reka berdasarkan agak agak dari masakan nasi goreng yang saya makan ...", "\n", "Oleh: ", "\n", "Bahan bahan", "Nasi", "Udang - buang kulit", "Isi ayam - potong kecil", "Telur", "Kangkung", "Kacang panjang - hiris nipis", "Karot - potong panjang", "Bawang merah - hiris", "Bawang putih - hiris", "Garam\u00a0", "Serbuk perasa", "\n", "Tumbuk:", "Cili merah", "Belacan", "Cili padi - tumbuk kasar", "Ikan bilis - tumbuk kasar", "\n", "Cara cara:", "Sediakan bahan bahan diperlukan.", "\n", "Panaskan minyak, tumis bawang merah dan bahan tumbuk sehingga wangi. Masukkan ayam dan goreng lagi sehingga masak.", "Masukkan kacang panjang dan karot. Kacau sebati dan masukkan kangkung.", "\n", "\n", "Ketepikan bahan goreng di dalam kuali, masukkan telur dan kacau rata.", "Masukkan nasi dan kacau sehingga bergaul rata. Akhir sekali masukkan garam dan serbuk perasa.", "Siap untuk dihidangkan.", "\n", "Enjoy ....", "\n", "\n"], "page_description_image_url": ["https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-9Ubv9m5EMdo/Tz5fvdLxvdI/AAAAAAAAG34/q4NocqcjfTM/s640/IMG_4458.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-abbk3JCPkgA/Tz5ft5u-s3I/AAAAAAAAG3w/4rBidAlsZb4/s640/IMG_4454.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-PTZOUPakQFQ/Tz5fgiHRzVI/AAAAAAAAG2o/X_gFblnyJyQ/s640/IMG_4427.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-VX6uMwot23E/Tz5fiYqLC1I/AAAAAAAAG2w/osnxCDc4IgU/s640/IMG_4429.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-qlT9d6pyrdI/Tz5fjzqHfaI/AAAAAAAAG24/dZxZiX--7D8/s640/IMG_4433.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-G45ssHNo8Ls/Tz5flMV8CkI/AAAAAAAAG3A/IVk_Pfl7t8Q/s640/IMG_4437.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-LUXYvHsIda4/Tz5fmpE4yUI/AAAAAAAAG3I/971DU9VRDiY/s640/IMG_4441.jpg", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-SFBS9SVD6mE/Tz5foMsdt7I/AAAAAAAAG3Q/6Ckn5XYojo8/s640/IMG_4444.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-wjhSGZyOFtM/Tz5fpgQOU_I/AAAAAAAAG3Y/xPgdbjNQRzQ/s640/IMG_4446.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-lO7dtLa6tVw/Tz5fq6Ib3rI/AAAAAAAAG3g/4VWfxOHrNlc/s640/IMG_4448.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-BjAiPbzU9sM/Tz5fsTdBKyI/AAAAAAAAG3o/KMgAafeqhNY/s640/IMG_4450.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-QV5wowGky7c/Tz5fw9BlePI/AAAAAAAAG4A/YWnysK-nFwo/s640/IMG_4462.jpg"], "page_ulasan_count": "15 ulasan", "page_comment": ["mcm best", "masuk banyak rencah, pasti sedap ", "Salam kak. Nak share =)", "Boleh. Silakan", "Salam kak.", "Nak share kat blog sy boleh?", "Thanks =D", "Boleh, tak jadi halangan", "Salam...Nak cuba ye resepi ni n resepi yg lain...TQVM", "serbuk perasa tu yg mcm mane ek?sy nie tk pandai msk,,,,tp tgk blog akak nie cm mudah je kn,,,nmpk sedap....", "Zaman dulu saya guna ajino moto, kini sya letak serbuk perasa secukup rasa adabi  atau knorr", "Salam kak. heee saya reader baru blog akak ni. aritu cari resepi cornflake madu, pastu godeh2 jumpa mcm2 resepi best2. utk sahur pg td, mlm semlm try wat nasi goreng ni. beza cuma xde carrot, pastu guna 2 ketul ayam percik x abis mkn dlm freezer, dgn guna maggi cukup rasa je x guna garam pon. mamma mia!! sedap giler x terkata!! thanks kak for sharing. pasni nak try wat cornflake milo lak. nak g kedai brg kuih beli golden syrup. heeeeeeeeeeee (^^,)v", "Sedap nye ns grg kg akak..", "Kalau guna belacan biasa yg xbakar lg tu boleh ke ye? Ke xsedap? Haha.", "cunnya awak masak..thanks ya 4 the info.", "hai isung sy sakit..tpi nasi goreng ni sedap", "Sedap gila nasi kalau pakai resepi ni"], "page_comment_time": ["15 September, 2012 12:49", "16 September, 2012 13:02", "04 Februari, 2013 15:46", "04 Februari, 2013 17:05", "04 Februari, 2013 15:48", "04 Februari, 2013 17:06", "13 Mac, 2013 12:02", "17 Mei, 2013 23:58", "18 Mei, 2013 08:55", "17 Julai, 2013 09:42", "20 Mac, 2014 10:34", "19 April, 2014 12:03", "31 Julai, 2014 01:11", "08 Julai, 2017 10:29", "28 April, 2020 17:37"], "page_comment_user": ["pensel kertas", "Azie", "Hati Hawa", "Azie", "Murni", "Azie", "Azie", "Sarah and Fad", "Unknown", "Unknown", "MaNMaN169", "Unknown", "ciksitifazilah"], "page_comment_user_url": ["https://www.blogger.com/profile/09683616862422088276", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02400541595248700580", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "http://duniaitusfera.blogspot.com/", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/020582522