/UUKu-RThd9I/AAAAAAAAAEI/9USTF4rJEbg/s35/DSC_8114.JPG", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-M_KBjD5_Ii8/UVPnjyUyHKI/AAAAAAAABAo/-0iEd-lzcgw/s35/aa.JPG", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png"]}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640923263", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=ayam&updated-max=2012-01-14T13:38:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=702&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2011/12/nasi-goreng.html", "list_item_title": "Nasi Goreng", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "12/31/2011", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n1 Comment\n", "list_item_category": "\nNasi\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Nasi?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640923267", "page_title": "Nasi Goreng", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "12/31/2011", "page_item_category": ["Nasi", "Nasi Goreng"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Nasi?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Nasi%20Goreng?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Pagi ni saya menggoreng nasi mengikut cara yang saya menyediakan nasi goreng sejak kecil di mana kesemua bahan ditumbuk dengan lesung batu. Yang paling saya tak suka ialah menumbuk cili kering, hmm lambat nak melumatkannya.\u00a0\u00a0", "Sayur pula hanya menggunakan sayuran yang ditanam sendiri seperti kacang panjang atau sayur sawi. Dah lama saya tak menggoreng nasi seperti ini, kini samada saya menggoreng nasi goreng cina atau menggoreng menggunakan perencah nasi goreng yang dibeli.", "Oleh kerana pagi pagi lagi hubby ke pejabat untuk year end closing, terpaksa lah saya menyediakan breakfast walaupun badan masih rasa tak sihat. Di samping nasi goreng, saya juga menyediakan daging goreng garam kunyit.", "Jom kita tengok apa yang saya sediakan untuk sarapan pagi ini. Resepi nya semua orang tahu, tapi tak apa lah, sekadar nak melengkapkan blog yang memaparkan kehidupan saya sendiri sejak kecil hingga sekarang. Jom layan...", "Nasi Goreng", "Oleh: Azie Kitchen", "Bahan bahan:", "Cili kisar secukupnya\u00a0", "Daging ", "6 ulas bawang merah", "3 ulas bawang putih", "2 biji telur ", "Sayuran", "Garam dan serbuk perasa", "Cara cara:", "Blend cili, bawang merah dan bawang putih.\u00a0 Panaskan kuali, tumis bahan yang dikisar hingga betul betul garing.\u00a0\u00a0", "Masukkan daging dan goreng lagi hingga daging masak. \u00a0", "Masukkan sayuran dan ketepikan bahan bahan ke tepi kuali, pecahkan telur. Kacau rata telur dan terus tuang nasi ke dalam kuali.\u00a0\u00a0", "Masukkan garam dan serbuk perasa.\u00a0 Kacau rata sebelum diangkat.", " "], "page_description_image_url": ["https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-x3JVN1R1r-4/Tv6TlTWu2gI/AAAAAAAADQg/qPCi1z0N6Ic/s640/IMG_8526.JPG", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-hPp6YgvnHrg/Tv6U8mzdLYI/AAAAAAAADQ8/t5v7eFsCl9A/s640/IMG_8537.JPG", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-7-USLa9HueQ/Tv6SLB0cE-I/AAAAAAAADPk/Qbg8UPzvPBQ/s640/IMG_8513.JPG", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-Z6v-lCqCg5A/Tv6SRINDXlI/AAAAAAAADPs/fGHjkxj5V30/s640/IMG_8514.JPG", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-kZB1Zxye3hM/Tv6SfnKffxI/AAAAAAAADP0/Jea4yAvecto/s640/IMG_8515.JPG", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-tuS9cel-JoA/Tv6SmdpoqWI/AAAAAAAADP8/p1k4f03i3S0/s640/IMG_8516.JPG", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-cJN7tJkW9_Q/Tv6SswJjpBI/AAAAAAAADQE/HT4Y65NkKWU/s640/IMG_8517.JPG", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-elusk7xdk8M/Tv6S1pZhexI/AAAAAAAADQM/QXx4f1x29M8/s640/IMG_8518.JPG", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-8KsX40JOTi8/Tv6TfYcxHHI/AAAAAAAADQY/GjtRR_KdT50/s640/IMG_8529.JPG"], "page_ulasan_count": "1 ulasan", "page_comment": [], "page_comment_time": ["01 Ogos, 2019 14:31"], "page_comment_user": ["Resepi Asia"], "page_comment_user_url": ["https://www.blogger.com/profile/16100502360628251078"], "page_comment_user_image_url": ["//2.bp.blogspot.com/-0DpcZIr9sW4/XNZgT5_SprI/AAAAAAAAABc/Bq4WRp7Q_hYOOK0-XrGr2lfOaFOwgTXhACK4BGAYYCw/s35/logo%25252Btwitter.jpg"]}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640923264", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=ayam&updated-max=2012-01-14T13:38:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=702&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2011/11/chicken-and-mushroom-quiche.html", "list_item_title": "Chicken and Mushroom Quiche", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "11/22/2011", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n3\n                              Comments\n                           \n", "list_item_category": "\nKuih Muih\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Kuih%20Muih?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640923269", "page_title": "Chicken and Mushroom Quiche", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "11/22/2011", "page_item_category": ["Kuih Muih", "Minum Petang", "Quiche"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Kuih%20Muih?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Minum%20Petang?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Quiche?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Saya dapat dan belajar resepi ini dari sahabat saya, TeeaRa Yatie yang memang handal memasak. Bila masuk fb, saya akan melihat lihat album masakan beliau. Yatie memang tidak lokek, beliau bukan saja memberi resepi tetapi juga coach saya jika ada apa apa yang tak jelas.", "Juita menyatakan hasratnya untuk cuba memasak Quiche yang kebetulan memang kegemaran anak saya Aween. Jadi balik saja office, kami terus ke Giant kerana my Laling hubby nak cepat balik rumah untuk menonton perlawanan bola\u00a0", "sepak antara Malaysia dan Indonesia pukul 8.00 malam.\u00a0", "Saat orang lain sedang berdegup degup jantung, saya relax menyediakan quiche dan siap makan dengan asyiknya. Bila saya duduk jer di depan TV, terus tendangan penalti kemenangan Malaysia. Macam tahu tahu jer timingnya, tak perlu nak menjerit jerit sebelumnya.", "Wa cakap sama lu aa, ini kuih sangat sedap tau... hahaha. Bahan bahannya pun simple jer, kalau dibeli, tentunya harganya mahal sekali.\u00a0", "Jadi apa kata cuba masak sendiri untuk hidangan keluarga tersayang. Pasti mereka gembira dihidangkan dengan quiche yang sangat yummy ...", "Jom kita tengok gambar gambar dan resepinya ....", "Oleh: ", "Bhn A:", "200 gm tepung gandum", "1ts salt", "Mixed herbs", "\n", "110 gm cold butter-kiubkan", "1 egg yolk", "1/4 tbs lemon juice", "50 ml air sejuk (dimasuk berselang seli)", "\n", "Campurkan bahan bahan hingga sebati dan tuangkan ke dalam bahan A. ", "Diuli sampai jadi doh dan rehatkan selama 15 minit dalam peti sejuk. Selepas itu, terapkan dalam pie mould yg boleh dikeluarkan plate dari bawah dan cucukkan tepung dengan garpu dan blind bake selama 15 minit.", "\n", "Chopped garlic", "2 tbs olive oil", "Capsicum", "Celeries ", "Button mushroom hiris nipis nipis", "Onion - potong kiub", "Minced chicken", "Chicken fillet green peppercorn", "Garam", "Mixed herbs", "\n", "Saut\u00e9 garlic, masukkan chicken fillet, goreng sekejap sebelum dimasukkan kesemua campuran sayuran. Masukkan garam dan sedikit mixed herbs. Ketepikan. ", "\n", "250 gm whipped cream", "Coarse black pepper", "4 biji telur", "Campurkan kesemua bahan dan kacau sebati.", "\n", "Selepas doh di bind bake selama 10 minit, masukkan filling sayuran tadi dan akhir sekali masukkan cream. Taburkan cheddar cheese yang diparut dan bakar selama 35 minit pada suhu 170C", "\n", "\n"], "page_description_image_url": ["https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-dE5jnbMZluU/TsupqLOiS7I/AAAAAAAAB60/lrPDwzH5xtU/s640/IMG_4952.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Bl4phoJ2B-Q/TsupsJ2ZakI/AAAAAAAAB68/V7bm3A39Vc4/s640/IMG_4963.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-gxmoTrlaqjY/TsqBWTPUy8I/AAAAAAAAB6M/YnO1B7SPZgA/s640/IMG_4939.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-iY1x6w-WdiM/TsqAqPpSj5I/AAAAAAAAB3k/pKXIQTJ7O9c/s640/IMG_4836.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-ZgP-cu_cke0/TsqAuBcFgQI/AAAAAAAAB30/dzARJwgs9RM/s640/IMG_4839.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-3yOxTNxVgok/TsqAwVlRmII/AAAAAAAAB38/cpxgiOivUCE/s640/IMG_4844.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-KRkUfaAuS2g/TsqAyvVraYI/AAAAAAAAB4E/hihFYs2X3jI/s640/IMG_4850.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-MH954_6_BVQ/TsqA0jDHD-I/AAAAAAAAB4M/iydJZr7tJJU/s640/IMG_4851.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-50g0VAlEzsM/TsqA2wkowBI/AAAAAAAAB4U/3Dv2B2ANn8o/s640/IMG_4854.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-fzUu_rmzyX0/TsqA5OFMTEI/AAAAAAAAB4c/tYEbYCEWDlE/s640/IMG_4858.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-y-km3UDkzWk/TsqA62RqJ-I/AAAAAAAAB4k/1q_H8LmKY2g/s640/IMG_4863.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-kRpLLGNSvrw/TsqA8xaWD5I/AAAAAAAAB4s/KUscYAlb3FQ/s640/IMG_4866.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-FFtu78fh5ig/TsqBA1bJSMI/AAAAAAAAB48/Wfpkn6q-80g/s640/IMG_4872.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-kpe_QbJmLeY/TsqBC9fvekI/AAAAAAAAB5E/qcW2IuFvfrg/s640/IMG_4874.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Y2tA5cF709o/TsqBJjigozI/AAAAAAAAB5c/_oxyC5THwao/s640/IMG_4883.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-4UHlprZNKdQ/TsqBLq22BrI/AAAAAAAAB5k/1_BS16dULYc/s640/IMG_4890.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-yUOJRovIuXU/TsqBNaLuSEI/AAAAAAAAB5s/ovnUKQD-aWo/s640/IMG_4892.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-Jp-d_bw2Avs/TsqBPuk0LwI/AAAAAAAAB50/BVlsXzUK17w/s640/IMG_4906.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-7xloSzNe7Ig/TsqBUuOUUVI/AAAAAAAAB6E/Zj21IZcmKp0/s640/IMG_4927.jpg", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-uu3W8Zb59bw/Tsupt8Em5dI/AAAAAAAAB7E/3GhfondRRuM/s640/IMG_4967.jpg"], "page_ulasan_count": "3 ulasan", "page_comment": ["tq kak atas resepi2 yg mengiorkn... akak my idol :) ", "moga allah murahkn rezeki dunia dan akhirat", "sedapnya kak, memang planning nak wat ni ", "Mohon halal kn resepi. Suka tgk resepi azie. Mudah jer rasa nk buat. Tqmoge sentiasa murah rezki"], "page_comment_time": ["20 Oktober, 2013 03:05", "15 April, 2019 16:04", "25 November, 2020 14:45"], "page_comment_user": ["imahYusoff", "mayangbakingmadness", "Unknown"], "page_comment_user_url": ["https://www.blogger.com/profile/13820800138773731746", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/05324210537276872894", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/10488244136503809597"], "page_comment_user_image_url": ["//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-apEw_meerQ0/XS8n4bxsY5I/AAAAAAAAFMM/4nQY97WEqvAPeIRciiHdAs-SEAl_gxqVQCK4BGAYYCw/s35/WhatsApp%25252BImage%25252B2019-03-14%25252Bat%25252B3.21.42%25252BPM%252525281%25252529.jpeg", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png"]}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640923268", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=ayam&updated-max=2011-11-22T01:08:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=706&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2011/11/kerutuk-daging.html", "list_item_title": "Kerutuk Daging", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "11/06/2011", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n Add Comment \n", "list_item_category": "\nDaging\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Daging?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640923270", "page_title": "Kerutuk Daging", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "11/06/2011", "page_item_category": ["Daging", "Lauk Pauk", "Masakan Kelantan"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Daging?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Lauk%20Pauk?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Masakan%20Kelantan?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Saya memasak kerutuk daging dengan daging qorban yang dibawa balik tadi. \u00a0Sangat cepat memasaknya kerana saya terlebih dahulu merebus daging dengan menggunakan pressure cooker. \u00a0Resepi nya boleh dirujuk pada ", "\u00a0 kerutuk ayam yang telah dibuat sebelum ini. \u00a0", "\n", "Jom kita layan gambar nya ...", "\n", "\n", "\n", "\n"], "page_description_image_url": ["https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-B1tvagwMJqc/Trarfjaf5_I/AAAAAAAABNA/voWLAkxdBcQ/s640/IMG_2471.JPG", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-cEJYVWB5PS0/Trarkaf0umI/AAAAAAAABNQ/ENIDj_XQwnU/s640/IMG_2468.JPG", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-CuW7oL3e2oA/TrariCy3fGI/AAAAAAAABNI/l3uXoZ4nqMM/s640/IMG_2464.JPG", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-iPhrzLBX7zo/TrarnAf0clI/AAAAAAAABNY/iu0JP_mgMu4/s640/IMG_2470.JPG"], "page_ulasan_count": null, "page_comment": [], "page_comment_time": [], "page_comment_user": [], "page_comment_user_url": [], "page_comment_user_image_url": []}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640923268", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=ayam&updated-max=2011-11-22T01:08:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=706&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2011/09/tetamu-datang-beraya-di-nur-qaseh.html", "list_item_title": "Tetamu Datang Beraya di Nur Qaseh", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "9/11/2011", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n Add Comment \n", "list_item_category": "\nRaya 2011\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Raya%202011?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640923271", "page_title": "Tetamu Datang Beraya di Nur Qaseh", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "9/11/2011", "page_item_category": ["Raya 2011"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Raya%202011?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Walaupun tidak mengadakan majlis rumah terbuka, beberapa orang teman rapat telah menelefon ingin berkunjung ke rumah untuk berhari raya. Kebetulan sekali, Nana mengadakan jamuan raya khas untuk kawan kawan sekolah dan kawan sama universiti, jadi kedatangan mereka diraikan dengan pelbagai juadah. Kami sangat gembira kerana tetamu datang membawa rezeki ke rumah dan rahmat yang melimpah.", "\n", "Walaupun majlis makan Nana menggunakan khidmat katering kerana saya memang tak larat memasak tanpa pembantu rumah, namun begitu, saya menyediakan juga beherapa juadah pencuci mulut berupa puding batek dan agar agar kastard serta juga rendang ayam yang dimakan bersama lemang sebab hubby kata kalau tak ada lemang, macam tak terasa suasana raya. Sebenarnya majlis ini dibuat di saat akhir atas permintaan Nana. Tapi kerja menjadi mudah kerana anak anak turut membantu memasak dan mengemas rumah. Sebagai ibu yang mementingkan kebahagiaan keluarga, saya cuba memenuhi keinginan beliau. Maklumlah sejak dia balik bercuti, saya sibuk urusan di pejabat. Kita perlu sentiasa berkorban masa dan wang ringgit demi anak anak kerana kita bekerja dan bertungkus lumus mencari rezeki juga untuk kesenangan anak anak. Dalam hidup kena ada keseimbangan kerana wang bukan segala galanya walaupun segala galanya memerlukan wang.", "\n", "Haaa panjang pulak celoteh pagi ini, al maklum lah setiap hari kita kena berazam untuk berbuat kebaikan .... Berbalik kepada sahabat karib dan famili yang mengunjungi, kami sangat berbesar hati dengan kunjungan dan merasa amat terharu. ", "\n", "bersama Suraya yang datang bersama anak gadisnya ", "Kunjungan Raja Shah & Feeza yg pertama selepas berpindah", "hidangan yang ringkas sahaja", "dari sudut berbeza", "Feeza yang lama tak bersua", "Terima kasih atas kunjungan En Abu Hassan & Sidah ", "lagi gambar bersama kawan kawan sepejabat", "My best friend Norsidah yang bertambah anggun", "Bakal bakal doktor..", "Kawan kawan Nana dari USJ", "As, Tihani dan Farhan turut mengunjungi", "Dato Abu dan Datin Ros singgah minum teh ", "Cheq, Kahar dan Dannia mencari laksa asam ... hahaha lain kali ya", "Din tetamu terakhir .. tetap sahabat sejati"], "page_description_image_url": ["//2.bp.blogspot.com/-lyIli7MRBzI/TmuWpHz1ZqI/AAAAAAAAARw/j3VhSssLJZ4/s640/IMG_4874.JPG", "//2.bp.blogspot.com/-CEcKZzY7lG4/TmwcMSGHI1I/AAAAAAAAATA/O94INRTur2Q/s640/IMG_4897.JPG", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-5b_NFz_M9XU/TmuWxRC5DZI/AAAAAAAAAR0/DYWiz-UAw6E/s640/IMG_4877.JPG", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-9FzSXgK3ch8/TmuW5Sg_3QI/AAAAAAAAAR4/SSkZO5An5C4/s640/IMG_4886.JPG", "//1.bp.blogspot.com/-5pc8XWrcR3w/TmuXB4-v8pI/AAAAAAAAAR8/mMGHxkF2JLc/s640/IMG_4887.JPG", "//2.bp.blogspot.com/-SnJisQqfj5w/TmuXJykbIkI/AAAAAAAAASA/6v6LKKS0CRE/s640/IMG_4893.JPG", "//1.bp.blogspot.com/-5pGoyawACfA/TmuXUscd8eI/AAAAAAAAASE/x40dHGiC9a4/s640/IMG_4905.JPG", "//2.bp.blogspot.com/-qk1R-fFR39U/TmuXml4286I/AAAAAAAAASI/9jL3n0MGdZw/s640/IMG_4906.JPG", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-tmaK5r7Kv80/TmwbM9PqqkI/AAAAAAAAAS8/d1NsyXh7FkA/s640/IMG_4902.JPG", "//2.bp.blogspot.com/-H8jUwro20oM/TmuX1fPqX_I/AAAAAAAAASM/lYd5H4XoqkI/s640/IMG_4908.JPG", "//1.bp.blogspot.com/-0fGxJCsEfwI/TmuYB6W-raI/AAAAAAAAASQ/W67lhczAbCI/s640/IMG_4916.JPG", "//2.bp.blogspot.com/-XXBzB8lNPm0/TmuYSNOaAEI/AAAAAAAAASU/1pWOBZG8Tpw/s640/IMG_4929.JPG", "//2.bp.blogspot.com/-IOntbngvVGU/TmuYekB1a3I/AAAAAAAAASY/MEn29FbSnto/s640/IMG_4997.JPG", "//1.bp.blogspot.com/-vs0P7c0gRkQ/TmuYoBBx73I/AAAAAAAAASc/-yOZMwmdWAc/s640/IMG_5020.JPG", "//2.bp.blogspot.com/-L3M6ZxVrAAw/TmuYygOLraI/AAAAAAAAASg/4j2f44fYpfI/s640/IMG_5022.JPG", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-4Ze2XPXowB0/TmuZAN6VSLI/AAAAAAAAASk/5Sqrxy2GUdE/s640/IMG_5081.JPG"], "page_ulasan_count": null, "page_comment": [], "page_comment_time": [], "page_comment_user": [], "page_comment_user_url": [], "page_comment_user_image_url": []}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640923268", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=ayam&updated-max=2011-11-22T01:08:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=706&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2011/10/kuih-cek-mek-molek.html", "list_item_title": "Kuih Cek Mek Molek", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "10/29/2011", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n34\n                              Comments\n                           \n", "list_item_category": "\nKuih Muih\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Kuih%20Muih?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640923273", "page_title": "Kuih Cek Mek Molek", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "10/29/2011", "page_item_category": ["Kuih Muih", "Masakan Kelantan", "Masakan Tradisional"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Kuih%20Muih?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Masakan%20Kelantan?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Masakan%20Tradisional?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Bangun pagi pagi hari sabtu, saya terus ke dapur.\u00a0 Berkobar kobar nak mengerjakan ubi stellor (ubi keledek lah weh) yang dibawa abang saya dari Kelantan.\u00a0 Nak buat kuih Cek Mek Molek lah.\u00a0\u00a0", "Kuih Cek Mek Molek adalah kuih yang biasa dibuat semasa saya kecil dahulu. Maklum bahan bahannya mudah. Kadang kadang arwah my father tanam sendiri jer ubi keledek tu. Kuih ini kalau di kampung saya, bukan saja dimakan sebagai hidangan petang tetapi juga sebagai kuih untuk sarapan pagi.", "Setiap kali balik Kelantan, saya memang tak lupa untuk membeli satu bag ubi keledek kerana harganya teramat murah berbanding dengan di KL. Jadi macam macam kuih yang menggunakan keledek saya ajar pembantu rumah untuk membuatnya.\u00a0", "Selain cek mek molek, boleh juga digoreng sebagai kaki ayam. Keledek dipotong kecil dan panjang seperti jari telunjuk dengan tepung beras, ala seperti menggoreng pisang tu ... Atau boleh juga dibuat sayuran dengan pucuk manis ke. Hmmm sedap tu. atau ubi keledek direbus dan dimakan gitu saja sebagai sarapan. Pendek kata macam macam boleh buat lah dengan ubi keledek ni.", "Jom kita layan resepi dan gambar gambar nya ...", "Kuih Cek Mek Molek", "Oleh: ", "\n", "Bahan bahan", "Ubi keledek oren", "Tepung gandum", "Sedikit gula", "\n", "Cara cara:", "Rebus ubi sampai empuk. Lenyekkan.", "\n", "Ubi yang telah dilenyek diuli dan digaul bersama tepung gandum. Agak agak lah kelembutan adunannya. Kalau terlebih gandum, adunan menjadi keras.\u00a0\u00a0", "Bentukkan kuih cek mek molek. Masukkan sesudu gula dan dibentuk membujur.\u00a0", "Goreng dalam minyak panas yang banyak dengan api perlahan agar gula hancur menjadi air gula semasa digoreng.\u00a0", "Angkat bila kekuningan. Awas gula panas, jadi berhati hati jika makan kuih cek mek molek semasa panas panas.", "\n"], "page_description_image_url": ["https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-R_B2lw2NJKM/Tqt7zSpiRHI/AAAAAAAAA2I/Oxx89uojAgI/s640/IMG_0677x.JPG", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-WLDsB5fnp0Q/Tqt73iMeShI/AAAAAAAAA2Y/CoxxB-2QNL4/s640/IMG_0694x.JPG", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-e411K4OlHw4/Tqt754cD8vI/AAAAAAAAA2g/eZNccDs4I_M/s640/IMG_0708x.JPG", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-OiuX-n1-vPU/Tqt_FLnnotI/AAAAAAAAA44/e5hYRwq1OWo/s640/IMG_0610.JPG", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-8-L9QGVG4jQ/Tqt_HShTj_I/AAAAAAAAA5A/GafwoZP9HHw/s640/IMG_0614.JPG", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-ox_gjCGRg7A/Tqt_KP3kRvI/AAAAAAAAA5I/7G_qrYnKcfE/s640/IMG_0618.JPG", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-F3tJzBUg5nw/Tqt_MJGsDwI/AAAAAAAAA5Q/nRj9vy8ce3g/s640/IMG_0640.JPG", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-Xoi0ZvDSPfU/Tqt_Pf-DJxI/AAAAAAAAA5Y/xwl7syWbpnk/s640/IMG_0641.JPG", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-l-7Yd99uMqQ/Tqt_RbdsW1I/AAAAAAAAA5g/W4w_GrBEUPA/s640/IMG_0643.JPG", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-uc26td4IADA/TquAh3PNSGI/AAAAAAAAA6Q/mA6QD7YWp8k/s640/IMG_0644.JPG", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-OF_vnueXR_w/TquA4BC_X7I/AAAAAAAAA6Y/3T7w3Vfv580/s640/IMG_0645.JPG", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-DNomtEHiyJI/TquAf5crbCI/AAAAAAAAA6I/kBjQeSdkv4Y/s640/IMG_0646.JPG", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-ybEKmcmBvXg/TquBXtN44cI/AAAAAAAAA6g/gD4F3zmH9hI/s640/IMG_0652.JPG", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/--DAnRxY10p4/TquB6uSsNTI/AAAAAAAAA64/eix1kdbhkn4/s640/IMG_0650.JPG", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-5SMN1AOFxmk/TquB8ZecA6I/AAAAAAAAA7A/gEoov-EZeu0/s640/IMG_0656.JPG", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-2GgjumoD3sY/TquB4nvb1SI/AAAAAAAAA6w/CP30D-Mi-hM/s640/IMG_0671.JPG", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-WNZPyy02E0M/Tqt71R7__FI/AAAAAAAAA2Q/8YWKN8JznP4/s640/IMG_0690x.JPG", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-N6cOvJAYqPk/Tqt772cBQVI/AAAAAAAAA2o/dIRUTKfmEOg/s640/IMG_0713x.JPG"], "page_ulasan_count": "34 ulasan", "page_comment": ["Tq for sharing..dah buat mlm td..mmg sedap..lama x buat cek mek molek ni..tp cek mek yg saya buat jd gemok2..hehe", "iburianaonlineshop.blogspot.com", "Baru try ni ... tgh menggoreng.. tq 4 sharing..1st time buat cek mek.. biasa buat kuih keria.", "tq sbb share resepi...mmg tgh cari..mengidam ni..sblh penang ni xde jual..kenala buat sendiri..hehe..izinkan sy share pic n resepi di fb sy ye..gmbar gula kuar dr kueh tu mmg menggiurkan", "rindu kat mak bila tgk kuih ni ... nk buat sndri xjdi2 lg .. ", "klo simpan dalam peti sejuk adunan tu boleh ke?masam x adunan tu ye..", "smooth jer tengok kak Azie buat, saya ni terkial2 masih belum menjadi setakat ni. baru jer beli keledek tadi, tu yang belek2 entry keledek akak ni. btw thanks for sharing all the recipes :D ", "Salam kak,,,Tgh mencuba ni...;) ..keledek Putih je...harapp mnjadii,,tq share resipe ", "Ade x bhn  laen yg bole digunakn selain keledek? :) terima kasih", "Ubi stelo\ud83e\udd23", "sedappnye.. boleh try.. :)", "Saya mohon share resepinya Puan..Tkasih", "puan.. blh bg tips mcm mana nak mgentel.. sbb smlm buat jd mcm lembek.. xtau laa.. x cukup gandum ke apa.. kan letak byk gandum jd keras.. tp agak mencabar laa nak mengentel tuh.. rse dh mmg ummpphh.. anak2 suka sgt.. tq in advanced.. - azah", "Bt adunan mcm bt cekodok tu.", "Try tambah gandum sedikit demi sedikit smp doh nya boleh digentel dan dileperkan. Kalau melekat tu, tandanya masih lembik", "Setiap kali nk msk...mesti cari blog aziejaya nie...bkn ape..simple dan mudah nk folow step...maklum jer la..laki msk camne...tqvm psl byk resipi sy cuba dlm nlog nie...tqvm...", "Tq mmg best", "Tg memang sedap", "Nak kena try nih", "Tq for sharing", "Tq for sharing", "Boleh buat untuk minum petang hari ni.", "Tq for sharing. Memang menggiurkan betul la bile tengok gambar..", "salam lau guna ubi stello purple boleh ke", "Guna ubi kayu pun sdap jgak...", "Sy follower azie kitchen..sgt terinspirasi dgn setiap resepi yg di post...t.ksh byk2....byk pahala puan bt blog mcm ni", "repeat cek mek molek..", "Kat adunan tepung tu kena letak gula or garam ke akak?", "Saya tak letak apa apa. ", "Klau saya letak marjerin sikit baru lagi sedap \ud83d\ude0a", "Boleh juga  tapi itu versi moden. Versi tradisional macam yg saya buat", "Mohon share", "Baru   nok  try buat. Rasanya  20tahun dulu  Saya  buat. ", "Blog utama plihan utk tho resepi..tq utk semua resepi...halalkan segala ilmu y sy dpt kt sini..tq kak azie", "Blh goreng Pakai air fryer x", "Tq akak, semoga akak murah rezeki atas tnjk ajar dberi"], "page_comment_time": ["06 Disember, 2013 10:54", "10 Disember, 2013 19:49", "03 Januari, 2014 13:14", "06 April, 2014 00:43", "18 Jun, 2014 09:06", "28 Oktober, 2014 23:19", "25 November, 2014 16:48", "23 Februari, 2015 20:09", "17 November, 2020 23:30", "03 Mac, 2015 13:12", "12 April, 2015 13:09", "11 Ogos, 2015 10:36", "20 November, 2015 00:56", "20 November, 2015 22:44", "31 Oktober, 2016 15:57", "16 September, 2015 17:20", "05 November, 2015 11:43", "12 November, 2016 14:43", "12 November, 2016 19:28", "12 November, 2016 20:58", "28 November, 2016 11:43", 