und_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png"]}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640923273", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=ayam&updated-max=2011-09-09T11:53:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=710&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2011/09/pulut-kuning-ekspress.html", "list_item_title": "Pulut Kuning Ekspress", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "9/02/2011", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n17\n                              Comments\n                           \n", "list_item_category": "\nPulut\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Pulut?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640923276", "page_title": "Pulut Kuning Ekspress", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "9/02/2011", "page_item_category": ["Pulut"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Pulut?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["\u00a0 ", "Saya teringin sekali belajar buat pulut kuning tapi rasanya malas pulak nak kukus. Maklumlah tak ada pembantu rumah! penat juga nak membasuh pengukus kemudiannya.\u00a0", "Jadi bila terjumpa resepi pulut kuning ekspress, terus ingin mencuba. walaupun percubaan pertama macam berkerak sikit kerana lambat mengeluarkan dari rice cooker selepas pulut masak, namum saya sangat gembira kerana berhasil memasak pulut kuning.\u00a0", "Insya Allah, lain kali, saya akan kukus pulut seperti yang sepatutnya. jom layan ....", "\n", "\u00a0", "Cara masak pulut kuning cepat..tapi hasilnya sama seperti di kukus.", "\n", "Bahan-bahan ( 5-6 org makan )", "2 cawan beras pulut", "1 cawan santan pekat + 1 cawan air panas", "1 sdt garam", "1 helai daun pandan", "1 sdb minyak masak", "Sedikit serbuk kunyit", "pewarna kuning", "\n", "Cara-cara", "Cuci beras pulut hingga bersih..masukkan semua bahan2 kedalam rice cooker", "Setelah mendidih..gaul pulut supaya tak berkerak..kemudian biarkan hingga masak..", "Sesuai dimakan bersama rendang, kari ayam & daging, kurma & sambal ikan bilis..", "\n", "Kaedah yg sama ini juga boleh digunakan( jgn masukkan serbuk kunyit) memasak pulut utk kuih serimuka, pulut serunding..pulut ini juga enak dimakan besama serawa durian..", "Selamat mencuba!\u00a0", "\n"], "page_description_image_url": ["https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-TcavmAxEhog/TlvQ6kg-8WI/AAAAAAAAAJ4/asQvXqV_Y-E/s640/IMG_2402.JPG", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-79LKP3Do1JU/TlvRGHTKEJI/AAAAAAAAAJ8/CH1Jan0CAsY/s640/IMG_2396.JPG"], "page_ulasan_count": "17 ulasan", "page_comment": ["Mudahnya...seronok saya jumpa resepi senang cam ni.. time kasih.. esok nak try buat :)", "Terima kasih share resepi.. esok first time nk ", "buat :)", "Nk tanya, cara masaknya... sukatan air, cam madak nasi ke??", "Ada sukatan air dsn santan dslam resepi", "biar hingga mask tu mksdnye lpas gaul wkt mndidih tu, ttp periuk nasi n biar kering ( mcm mask nasi) ke?", "Saya dah try. Menjadi terima kasih. Sesuai untuk buat minum petang. Pulut dengan kelapa n gula apong", "senangnya masak pulut kuning -", "Satu sudu besar minyak tu. Sudu makan ke apa ye? ", "Tak perlu rendam ye pulut tu 1 mlm sebelum masak?", "Ninie", "Saya guna pulut susu. Rendam 15-20 minit pun dah ok", "pulut susu tu yg macam mana ye\ud83d\ude01", "Salah satu dari jenis jenis beras pulut. Ada ditulis di paket, pulut susu. Cepat masak. Tak perlu rendam lama. ", "kalau nak masak banyak, cth: 6 cawan beras pulut..still menjadi tak?", "Assalammualaikum Kak azie.. saya pun selalu buat Cara cmni tapi pelik la.. ni Kali kedua saya buat , Masih tak menjadi.. rase okay , sedap.. tpi nampak cm tak kering..", "Terima kasih,kalau nak buat untuk 50 orang makan, barapa pula sukatan beras,santan paket nya ya?", "pulut kuning kana yang terbaik lah -", "Sy bru nk cube bsok"], "page_comment_time": ["17 Ogos, 2015 15:05", "18 September, 2015 21:25", "30 Mac, 2016 21:22", "30 Mac, 2016 23:36", "18 Jun, 2016 13:27", "13 Ogos, 2016 00:15", "05 September, 2016 08:49", "23 Januari, 2017 08:49", "27 Februari, 2017 20:13", "27 Februari, 2017 22:55", "07 Julai, 2017 14:24", "07 Julai, 2017 14:30", "30 November, 2017 11:45", "16 Februari, 2018 15:51", "01 Februari, 2019 11:53", "19 April, 2020 09:16", "26 Mac, 2021 00:47"], "page_comment_user": ["Suhaila", "BLOG PSS SMK HILLCREST", "Unknown", "Azie", "Unknown", "Unknown", "Unknown", "Unknown", "dieninie", "Azie", "Unknown", "Azie", "Unknown", "Unknown", "HIDAYAH Egypt", "Stellarix", "Unknown"], "page_comment_user_url": ["https://www.blogger.com/profile/10522606949856653576", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/11068551369793390523", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/10422717868113392559", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/15730271913362161652", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/01011686974934359950", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/12438614368573789753", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/11598785523404171286", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/06084652534704681884", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/16244168932587672508", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/10462169632244089037", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/03879283454595684782", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/00300423263079045746", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/03288412063261005595", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/04720360549220761286"], "page_comment_user_image_url": ["//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//2.bp.blogspot.com/_KDtR7Aukst4/SjDG9B3THBI/AAAAAAAAAAk/-M3s3CGSCdQ/S45-s35/edit.jpg", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//2.bp.blogspot.com/-WfQR3j-Yzls/XszNg-S0iaI/AAAAAAAAFg0/GrT-HzJzHk4zGAR1lQxDeG2AtLamXvYCwCK4BGAYYCw/s35/telescope-sam-1.jpg", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png"]}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640923273", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=ayam&updated-max=2011-09-09T11:53:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=710&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2011/08/sambal-tumis-udang-dengan-petai.html", "list_item_title": "Sambal Tumis Udang dengan Petai", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "8/30/2011", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n2\n                              Comments\n                           \n", "list_item_category": "\nLauk Pauk\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Lauk%20Pauk?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640923278", "page_title": "Sambal Tumis Udang dengan Petai", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "8/30/2011", "page_item_category": ["Lauk Pauk", "Udang"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Lauk%20Pauk?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Udang?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Esok umat islam akan menyambut Hari Raya Aidil Fitri.\u00a0 Sambil menyediakan juadah untuk sarapan di pagi hari raya, saya perlu juga menyediakan juadah berbuka untuk hari terakhir Ramadhan.\u00a0 Menu berbuka hari ini adalah sambal tumis udang dengan petai, kari ikan bawal, ayam goreng rangup dan rendang minang yang dimasak untuk juadah raya.\u00a0 ", "\n", "\nSambal tumis udang adalah masakan kegemaran suami saya. Saya pula bila masak sambal tumis, hmmm ...sekali menjadi, sekali tak menjadi. saya belajar dan mempraktis masakan mudah ini berulang kali bagi menghasilkan sambal tumis udang yang meletop...", "\n", "Kali ini saya meletakkan sekali petai yang menjadi kegemaran saya tapi jarang memakannya terutama hari bekerja. apalagi esok hari raya. jom layan resepi saya....", "Sambal Tumis Udang", "Oleh: Azie Kitchen", "\n", "Bahan bahan:", "Cili kisar", "Bawang besar", "Bawang putih", "Halia", "Garam dan serbuk perasa", "\n", "Cara cara:", "Udang digoreng terlebih dahulu dan angkat serta ketepikan. semua bahan di atas di blend. ", "Tumis bahan blend dengan api perlahan hingga cili betul betul garing. Masukkan gula terlebih dahulu bagi menjadikan sambal berwarna kemerahan.\u00a0", "Selepas itu, masukkan air asam jawa, garam dan serbuk perasa. akhir sekali masukkan udang. masukkan sedikit air jika kuah terlalu pekat.", "Jika hendak masukkan petai, letak petai dahulu sebelum udang. jika mahu, boleh juga diletakkan bawang besar yang dipotong bulat.", "Siap dan jemputlah makan...."], "page_description_image_url": ["https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-62TdusoMy40/TlvCJCDy1SI/AAAAAAAAAI0/em9XrSsSHrc/s640/IMG_2261.JPG", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-7HkWp7GcIH0/TlvCUeQiWaI/AAAAAAAAAI4/VElkApJMiRo/s640/IMG_2272.JPG", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-2mXLbpvuvug/TlvCmWOe1BI/AAAAAAAAAI8/hG27OGt2U0U/s640/IMG_2256.JPG", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-CUKfFR9x75M/TlvCr2HPeyI/AAAAAAAAAJA/E__4n7gqkkw/s640/IMG_2253.JPG"], "page_ulasan_count": "2 ulasan", "page_comment": ["Assalam Azie, saya dari Kuching, Sarawak. Cantik warna sambal tumis udang petai awak. Dapat satu ilmu baru, rupa2 bila kita masukkan gula terlebih dulu boleh mencantikkan warna masakan kita. InsyaAllah, nanti saya cuba. Saya pun baru lagi dlm dunia blog ni. Wassalam", "Nor Asmah, ya bila dimasuk gula terlebih dahulu, sambal menjadi warna merah yang cantik dan berkilat. Saya juga belajar dari kawan yang memang pakar dalam bab memasak ni. begitu juga jika dikukis pulut kuning, taburkan sedikit gula sebelum dihidangkan. Pulut menjadi cantik berkilat."], "page_comment_time": ["09 Februari, 2012 17:02", "12 Februari, 2012 15:09"], "page_comment_user": ["Nor Asmah Semawi", "Azie"], "page_comment_user_url": ["https://www.blogger.com/profile/13303806745656197207", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318"], "page_comment_user_image_url": ["//3.bp.blogspot.com/-8tdX5mXdaUc/T40WCZxa8aI/AAAAAAAAASY/DiqK0az0qeI/s35/IMG_2163.JPG", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*"]}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640923273", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=ayam&updated-max=2011-09-09T11:53:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=710&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2011/08/kari-ikan.html", "list_item_title": "Kari Ikan Bawal", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "8/30/2011", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n Add Comment \n", "list_item_category": "\nIkan\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Ikan?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640923280", "page_title": "Kari Ikan Bawal", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "8/30/2011", "page_item_category": ["Ikan", "Lauk Pauk"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Ikan?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Lauk%20Pauk?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Seperti yang saya celotehkan dulu, saya bukan penggemar ikan, apalagi masak kari kari. Kami hanya tahu gulai ikan masak lemak atau gulai ikan rebus masak lemak. Alaaa yang macam lauk untuk nasi berlauk pagi pagi tu. Kami hanya masak kari bila\u00a0daging atau ayam sahaja.\u00a0 ", "Tapi bila berkahwin, keluarga suami penggemar kari terutama kari ikan. Terpaksa la belajar bagaimana nak memasak kari, check dengan kawan kawan facebook cara cara masak kari yang sedap.\u00a0 Maklumlah nak menambat hati suami la katakan.\u00a0\u00a0", "Jom layan, resepi kari yang saya pelajari...", "Kari ikan ", "Oleh: Azie Kitchen", "Bahan bahan:", "3 tangkai cili api - potong halus halus", "Halia sebesar ibu jari - dirincih", "5 ulas bawang merah - dihiris", "4 ulas bawang putih - dihris", "1 pelepah daun kari", "2 pek kari babas ikan", "1 sudu kecil pes asam jawa", "2 sudu kecil garam", "I sudu kecil serbuk perasa", "\n", "Cara cara:", "Panaskan 2 senduk minyak dalam kuali. (kalau terlebih, buang minyak bila kari dah siap)", "Tumis cili api, bahan hiris hingga layu.\u00a0 Masukkan kari dan digoreng sampai naik minyak.", "Masuk air 1 mug bagi kari masak. pastu bila minyak dah timbul lagi masuk lagi 4 mug air...tengoklah banyak mana ikan yang kita nak masak tu...bila kuah dah mendidih masukkan ikan biarkan mendidih lagi...pastikan ikan tenggelam...balikkan ikan ..", "Masukkan sedikit asam jawa sebab masak ikan...1 sudu teh je..", "Bila ikan dah masak masukkan bendi dan tomato yang dibelah-belah...", "Masukan garam dan serbuk perasa...bila sayur dah masak angkatla.. ", "Kalau masak kari ikan, tak masuk santan pun ok...", "masih di periuk ..."], "page_description_image_url": ["https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-oaRqDBjCios/TlvDRLIptXI/AAAAAAAAAJE/xajLsxAdkn4/s640/IMG_2294.JPG", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-8-0gW4ipeZE/TlvDYg7L1JI/AAAAAAAAAJI/PkY4axV9Yd8/s640/IMG_2299.JPG", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-gGfFaK9NqDI/TlvDuTgCPyI/AAAAAAAAAJQ/o_OiBoDmVw0/s640/IMG_2312.JPG", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-mAUFTuFIyQg/TlvDmCAQA0I/AAAAAAAAAJM/DndBVLAAuQU/s640/IMG_2236.JPG"], "page_ulasan_count": null, "page_comment": [], "page_comment_time": [], "page_comment_user": [], "page_comment_user_url": [], "page_comment_user_image_url": []}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640923273", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=ayam&updated-max=2011-09-09T11:53:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=710&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2011/09/rendang-minang.html", "list_item_title": "Rendang Daging Minang", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "9/02/2011", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n6\n                              Comments\n                           \n", "list_item_category": "\nDaging\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Daging?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640923281", "page_title": "Rendang Daging Minang", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "9/02/2011", "page_item_category": ["Daging", "Lauk Pauk", "Masakan Minang"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Daging?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Lauk%20Pauk?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Masakan%20Minang?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Berminggu saya memikirkan juadah yang ingin disediakan pada hari raya memandangkan tahun ini tahun pertama akan beraya di rumah sendiri. Seperti ibu bapa yang lain, kami juga menunggu kepulangan anak anak balik bercuti sempena hari raya.", "Banyak jenis rendang tapi rendang apa yang nak dibuat. Fikir punya fikir, cari punya cari, akhirnya saya putuskan untuk memasak rendang minang, resepi turun temurun teman sepejabat.\u00a0", "Terima kasih Rohaya kerana berkongsi resepi. jom layan resepi dan gambar gambar kerana hobi saya adalah fotografi....", "\n", "Rendang Minang", "Oleh: ", "Bahan bahan:", "1 kg daging atau ayam", "2 kg bawang merah", "1 kg bawang putih", "\u00bd kg halia", "\u00bd kg lengkuas - tumbuk", "3 biji buah keras - tumbuk", "3 btg serai\u00a0", "\u00bd kg cili kering", "Segenggam cili padi - ikut suka", "3 biji santan pekat", "3 biji santan cair", "\u00bd biji kelapa - kerisik", "2 kpg besar asam keping", "Gula, garam", "Bahan penumis: bunga lawang, kulit kayu manis,\u00a0", "Cara cara:", "Tumis bahan penumis, masukkan bawang putih, halia, bawang merah yang telah dihiris hingga naik bau.", "Masukkan cili dan lengkuas. Masak lagi seketika. Masukkan daging dan santan cair, masak hingga daging empuk.", "Masukkan santan pekat dan masak dengan api perlahan. Akhir sekali, masukkan kerisik, gula, garam dan asam keping. Sesuaikan rasa.", "siap ..."], "page_description_image_url": ["https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-ubJ0Ma2ryFo/TlvOrwONOfI/AAAAAAAAAJs/d9EoU7EsNDw/s640/IMG_2365.JPG", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-YcxRqv3ggQU/TlvOgIdcwMI/AAAAAAAAAJo/WyGJ7Q8ZIc8/s640/IMG_2385.JPG", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-ZzQhXrM7Klg/TlvPOhTEvdI/AAAAAAAAAJw/EPKYWGKTio8/s640/IMG_2394.JPG", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-pXZiJKn4mwQ/TlvPYai_YfI/AAAAAAAAAJ0/9CzHn-OpWls/s640/IMG_2358.JPG"], "page_ulasan_count": "6 ulasan", "page_comment": ["saya kongsikan di page saya ya...", "Timakasih, arini saya merendang siap utk raya.", "Assalam kak Azie.. ", "Memang pakai 1/2 kg halia, 1/2 kg lengkuas utk 1 kg daging?", "Kak, 1kg bawang putih, 2kg bawang merah, 1/2kg halia tu betul ke kak? ", "Rendang minang ni mmg byk guna bahan yer? Raya last year dh try buat rendang ni tp sy derhaka sikit kurangkan bahan\ud83d\ude01.tp still sedap,ank sy request raya ni buat rendang ni lg,terima kasih azie ..atas setiap resepi yg azie kongsi,sy mmg selalu gjna resepi azie kitchen", "Nak sedap, mmg kena letak banyak bahan"], "page_comment_time": ["13 Jun, 2017 09:45", "22 Jun, 2017 16:19", "18 Mei, 2020 14:02", "23 Mei, 2020 15:28", "10 Mei, 2021 08:56", "12 Mei, 2021 17:39"], "page_comment_user": ["Unknown", "Unknown", "Unknown", "AA", "Zura", "Azie"], "page_comment_user_url": ["https://www.blogger.com/profile/07409997383146874663", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02481477114840575862", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/17135409721090242331", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/13984988534356740913", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/04054546151296915126", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/00119325245731532820"], "page_comment_user_image_url": ["//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//2.bp.blogspot.com/-79pjwLUvjGc/WcsoSP2YqrI/AAAAAAAAARQ/VsAAnjtA8k8gv1gVAjerXyHsueNvQio4gCK4BGAYYCw/s35/1a.jpg"]}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640923273", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=ayam&updated-max=2011-09-09T11:53:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=710&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2011/08/rendang-daging.html", "list_item_title": "Rendang Daging", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "8/19/2011", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n1 Comment\n", "list_item_category": "\nDaging\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Daging?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640923281", "page_title": "Rendang Daging", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "8/19/2011", "page_item_category": ["Daging", "Lauk Pauk"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Daging?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Lauk%20Pauk?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Sebelum balik beraya pada hari raya tahun lepas, saya mencari resepi rendang daging yang baru untuk dicuba. Saya menemui beberapa resepi rendang daging yang hampir sama bahan bahan nya.\u00a0", "Seperti biasa, saya akan gabungkan kedua dua resepi untuk menjadikan satu resepi. Resepi ini lah yang saya dan Nana masak semasa di kampung dulu. ", "Layaannn gambar rendang daging yang saya sediakan sebelum ini...", "Oleh: Azie Kitchen", "Bahan bahan:", "1 kg daging - potong kecil ", "2 peket kecil rempah kurma ", "1/4 cawan kerisik ", "1 biji kelapa - ambik santannya ", "Garam ", "Gula melaka/gula ", "\u00bd cawan air asam jawa or 1-2 kpg asam", "1 kiub ayam knorr/serbuk perasa - opsyenal", "\u00a0", "Bahan kisar:", "2 labu bawang besar ", "5 ulas bawang putih ", "5 batang serai ", "1 1/2 cm halia ", "1 1/2 cm lengkuas ", "15-20 biji cili kering ", "Bahan mayang: ", "3 helai daun limau purut ", "1 helai daun kunyit ", "Cara-cara: ", "Tumis bahan yang dikisar sehingga naik bau. Masukkan rempah kurma. Tumis lagi sehingga berbau. ", "Masukkan daging, kacau rata. Biarkan 2-3 minit. Kemudian masukkan santan. Bila agak-agak daging dah lembut, masukkan air asam jawa, garam dan gula. ", "Bila daging dah betul lembut, masukkan pula kerisik dan gaul rata. ", "Akhir sekali masukkan daun yang dimayang, biarkan sehingga kuah agak pekat. "], "page_description_image_url": ["https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-au4p9V4Y03o/Tk2zI7RReRI/AAAAAAAAABM/q2ir01SL32Q/s640/39895_1586603070266_1391465442_31534864_4945576_n.jpg"], "page_ulasan_count": "1 ulasan", "page_comment": ["AsSalam .. 1kg dgg biase hidangan tuk brape org ye sis"], "page_comment_time": ["28 Julai, 2016 00:45"], "page_comment_user": ["Unknown"], "page_comment_user_url": ["https://www.blogger.com/profile/11272654463338541536"], "page_comment_user_image_url": ["//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png"]}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640923273", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=ayam&updated-max=2011-09-09T11:53:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=710&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2011/08/spaghetti-carbonara.html", "list_item_title": "Spaghetti Carbonara", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "8/19/2011", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n14\n                              Comments\n                           \n", "list_item_category": "\nmee\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/mee?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640923282", "page_title": "Spaghetti Carbonara", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "8/19/2011", "page_item_category": ["mee", "Pasta"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/mee?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Pasta?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Kecanggihan teknologi membantu kita untuk berkongsi maklumat\u00a0di seluruh pelusuk dunia. Dunia menjadi tanpa sempadan. Saya menggunakan sepenuhnya teknologi ini untuk melayan hobi mencuba resepi resepi baru.\u00a0", "Melihatkan anak anak yang gemar sekali memakan spagethi Carbonara, saya memutuskan untuk cuba memasaknya sendiri. Setelah mencari berhari hari lamanya resepi dan petua untuk memasak pasta ini, saya telah memasak menggunakan resepi di bawah yang telah saya gabungkan dari beberapa resepi...\u00a0", "Walaupun gambarnya nampak tak menarik, tapi rasanya hmmm sedap...\u00a0", "Jom layan resepinya....", "Oleh: ", "Bahan bahan:", "1/2 ketul buttercup", "\nSedikit olive oil", "\n4 ulas bawang putih (cincang)", "\n1/2 pek daging cincang ramli (atau dada ayam)", "\n1 tin mushroom soup campbell", "\n1 kotak kecil fresh milk", "\n3-5 keping cheese kraft", "\nCendawan butang", "\nBlack pepper", "\nFresh parsley", "\n", "Panaskan kuali, masukkan sedikit olive oil dan \u00bd buku butter cup. Masukkan bawang putih yang diketuk dan cincang (bawang besar potong dadu, jika suka) hingga kekuningan. Masukkan daging cincang dan angkat. ", "\n", "\nGuna kuali yang\u00a0sama, masukkan 1 tin mushroom soup Campbell classic dan 1 tin air.\u00a0\u00a0Kacau rata dan bila tak berketul, baru buka api.", "Masukkan 1 kotak kecil fresh milk dan 3 kpg cheese kraft, masukkan black pepper, garam dan 1 sudu gula. ", "\n", "\nTuang daging tadi dalam sos mushroom. ", "Tuang sos atas spaghetti bila nak dimakan. Tabur parmesan cheese, daun parsley dan black pepper"], "page_description_image_url": ["https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-ZoVeV9l7Kpk/Tk22N1YTDgI/AAAAAAAAABQ/fY2EwNNG2mc/s640/34271_1545664086817_1391465442_31423031_4155081_n.jpg"], "page_ulasan_count": "14 ulasan", "page_comment": ["slm...", "akak nk bertanya...", "susu kotak fresh milk 2..yg berapa ml ye??? byk kotak xtau saiz yg mna..", "Oh saya guna kotak yg kecil sekali. Tak perasan pula brp ml. Sebesar kotak santan, rasanya dalam 200ml. Lebih kurang pun OK. Rasanya ada entri yg saya tunjukkkan step by step. Cuba search", "Hidangan ni utk berapa org?", "Tak pasti. Kami makan aekeluarga siap menambah nambah lagi. Maknanya 10-12 orang pun boleh. ", "Kak Azie guna black pepper yang ditumbuk halus atau ready made black pepper yang serbuk tu macam brand ajinomoto? :D ", "Guna yg fresh yg ditumbuk sendiri lagi sedap", "Akum kak...klu gune susu cair dlm tin boleh ke..liya", "Boleh juga. Tapi rasa mungkin lain dg fresh milk", "nak cuba lah untuk buka puasa ptg ni.. mcm sedap jer. tq resepi", "Anak saya mmg suka mkn spegetti..satu hari tetiba anak saya minta saya msk speggiti cabonara .nak ckp x pandai malu la plk..tapi dlm senyap saya gogle  x sangka azie kitchen mmg penyelamat membantu dlm apa apa je resepi tq azie kitchen.", "Resepi ni untuk brp pek spaghetti?", "Assalamualaikum, nak tanye cendawan butang tu banyak mana Dan masa bila ya nak letak ?", "Selepas masuk daging pun boleh sb tak blh terlalu masak. Letak banyak mana pun ok. Sb ianya sedap", "klu tak nak daging, sekira nya di tukar dgn sausage blh kan?"], "page_comment_time": ["11 September, 2012 16:22", "11 September, 2012 17:09", "07 Ogos, 2014 10:57", "07 Ogos, 2014 12:47", "03 Oktober, 2015 06:51", "03 Oktober, 2015 10:20", "06 Jun, 2016 08:12", "06 Jun, 2016 11:09", "15 Jun, 2016 10:41", "26 Mac, 2017 17:40", "28 Mei, 2017 12:12", "02 Jun, 2019 00:35", "02 Jun, 2019 00:43", "13 April, 2020 21:28"], "page_comment_user": ["syiekin", "Azie", "nourin", "Azie", "Unknown", "Azie", "Unknown", "Azie", "Engku Artini", "Unknown", "Unknown", "Azie", "Unknown"], "page_comment_user_url": ["https://www.blogger.com/profile/10307892166976346263", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/17055742475284605103", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/16159064835001609748", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02595748510341533253", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/08185383738979971000", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/01771074349566401108", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/15912926250714785357", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/00119325245731532820", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/05085430462806135234"], "page_comment_user_image_url": ["//1.bp.blogspot.com/-q8M1UGQ_77A/UrEKBe5ImuI/AAAAAAAAAQE/14GM4bvx44s/s35/1474500_571541936257878_924269327_n%2525255B1%2525255D.jpg", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//1.bp.blogspot.com/_XHEvtxVAmoQ/SjDI89sbq5I/AAAAAAAAAlo/JZ2glJbHXcY/S45-s35/P1000596.JPG", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//resources.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//2.bp.blogspot.com/-79pjwLUvjGc/WcsoSP2YqrI/AAAAAAAAARQ/VsAAnjtA8k8gv1gVAjerXyHsueNvQio4gCK4BGAYYCw/s35/1a.jpg", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png"]}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640923273", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=ayam&updated-max=2011-09-09T11:53:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=710&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2011/08/udang-harimau-masak-lemak-cili-padi.html", "list_item_title": "Udang Harimau Masak Lemak Cili Padi", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "8/24/2011", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n Add Comment \n", "list_item_category": "\nLauk Pauk\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Lauk%20Pauk?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640923283", "page_title": "Udang Harimau Masak Lemak Cili Padi", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "8/24/2011", "page_item_category": ["Lauk Pauk", "Udang"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Lauk%20Pauk?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Udang?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Terlerai rindu dengan kepulangan anakanda kami, Nana dari Egypt. Walaupun kesuntukan masa, saya masih sempat memasak semua lauk untuk juadah berbuka hari ini. Betul betul bersilat, sebaik sampai di rumah, terus ke dapur memasak dengan tak sempat menyalin baju kerja pun. Akibatnya habis baju terpercik minyak semasa menggoreng. Aduhai la pulak tu ...", "Lauk yang sempat disediakan adalah Udang Harimau Masak Lemak Cili Padi, Ikan Bawal Sweet Sour, Ayam Masak Kicap dan Ikan Bawal Madu Goreng Garam Kunyit. Hmm... ada yang kurang sebenarnya, apa lagi kalau bukan sayur.\u00a0", "Tapi sebab anak anak tak suka makan sayur termasuk bakal doktor, saya pun tak jadi memasak sayur.\u00a0Walaupun resepi masakan di atas adalah resepi mudah yang semua orang tahu cara memasaknya tapi jom layan aje la resepi dan gambar gambar masakan hari ini ya...", "\n", "Udang Masak Lemak Cili Padi", "Oleh: Azie Kitchen", "Bahan bahan:", "Cili padi", "Kunyit hidup", "\nSantan", "\nAsam keping", "\nDaun kunyit, tomato buah", "Garam", "Blend cili padi dan kunyit hidup. Masak santan dengan bahan kisar hingga mendidih, masukkan udang, daun kunyit, tomato buah, asam keping, garam dan serbuk perasa. siap.\u00a0\u00a0", "Masak lemak cili padi ini adalah resepi kegemaran saya untuk lauk berkuah kerana mudah, cepat dan sedap.", "Siap ...", "masih di kuali ..."], "page_description_image_url": ["https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-aYkZm2n8whc/TlTzE859BnI/AAAAAAAAAHI/CFLw_kxRveU/s640/IMG_1687.JPG", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-HxYMvBqvjtw/TlTy0DXc7SI/AAAAAAAAAHE/DKKrZWte7XY/s640/IMG_1676.JPG", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-F6aGeOsTh4g/TlT0Ja0sAuI/AAAAAAAAAHU/kEXDvPP-2d4/s640/IMG_1690.JPG", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-e8lGHnslUBE/TlTzm4WIMEI/AAAAAAAAAHQ/JFmLHrb_6OI/s640/IMG_1674.JPG"], "page_ulasan_count": null, "page_comment": [], "page_comment_time": [], "page_comment_user": [], "page_comment_user_url": [], "page_comment_user_image_url": []}
